(3503222, 491093, 23484, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot. I love it. Fantastic processing.  This is a favorite. 10</td>', 'Very nice shot. I love it. Fantastic processing.  This is a favorite. 10', '2007-04-01 01:25:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3503226, 490998, 39144, '<td valign="top">Although I really like the compositional aspects of this photograph with the backlit grass, clear blue sky with faint, almost pastel, clouds in the distance, the sun is just too powerful. How to correct it, I don''t know. Maybe the use of a graduated ND filter or something. This is not something I have attempted, and I do not believe I could come up with something even this good to begin. So, kudos to you. Nice work, just keep it up.</td>', 'Although I really like the compositional aspects of this photograph with the backlit grass, clear blue sky with faint, almost pastel, clouds in the distance, the sun is just too powerful. How to correct it, I don''t know. Maybe the use of a graduated ND filter or something. This is not something I have attempted, and I do not believe I could come up with something even this good to begin. So, kudos to you. Nice work, just keep it up.', '2007-04-01 01:26:19.000000', NULL, 1),
