(3503403, 487518, 62637, '<td valign="top">Pipe?  Hip?  Rule #1 of snowboard photography, you gotta show the feature the rider is hitting!  (I know, I''ve broken it myself, but I know better now!)  Indy grabs are nothing special either...  I hope there was some crazy spinning going on here!<br/> <br/>Anyway, I''m being overly critical.  Still a good shot, but it wouldn''t be finding its way into any snowboard mags.  7</td>', 'Pipe?  Hip?  Rule #1 of snowboard photography, you gotta show the feature the rider is hitting!  (I know, I''ve broken it myself, but I know better now!)  Indy grabs are nothing special either...  I hope there was some crazy spinning going on here! Anyway, I''m being overly critical.  Still a good shot, but it wouldn''t be finding its way into any snowboard mags.  7', '2007-04-01 02:02:05.000000', NULL, 1),
