(3504276, 489867, 53316, '<td valign="top">Great colors! Blue and green background and yellowish and pinkish with face and lips... just a nice combination.</td>', 'Great colors! Blue and green background and yellowish and pinkish with face and lips... just a nice combination.', '2007-04-01 05:34:39.000000', NULL, 1),
