(3504552, 491115, 5822, '<td valign="top">This is actually a pretty good composition but your lighting is too strong and you it appears you haven''t compensated for incandescent lighting with white balance, either in your camera, or in post processing.</td>', 'This is actually a pretty good composition but your lighting is too strong and you it appears you haven''t compensated for incandescent lighting with white balance, either in your camera, or in post processing.', '2007-04-01 06:41:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(3504571, 487902, 5822, '<td valign="top">Interesting composition but I think a little too heavy on the grunge and not enough DOF to really see well the background, which, imo, is more interesting than the foreground fence.</td>', 'Interesting composition but I think a little too heavy on the grunge and not enough DOF to really see well the background, which, imo, is more interesting than the foreground fence.', '2007-04-01 06:47:56.000000', NULL, 1),
