(3504584, 490895, 36999, '<td valign="top">lovely color palatte!  I like the framing by the branches too.  Too bad that dash of pink wasn''t right behind the monument, would have been the icing on the cake</td>', 'lovely color palatte!  I like the framing by the branches too.  Too bad that dash of pink wasn''t right behind the monument, would have been the icing on the cake', '2007-04-01 06:53:42.000000', NULL, 1),
