(3504648, 490456, 5822, '<td valign="top">Great capture of expression and "hairdo," but post is a litte bit too heavy. There''s a nice combination of wildness and anthropomorphism going on here. I''m undecided on the background brightness as I think it should be toned down a bit. I wouldn''t be at all surprised if this was a ribbon winner, and my score will reflect that as well.</td>', 'Great capture of expression and "hairdo," but post is a litte bit too heavy. There''s a nice combination of wildness and anthropomorphism going on here. I''m undecided on the background brightness as I think it should be toned down a bit. I wouldn''t be at all surprised if this was a ribbon winner, and my score will reflect that as well.', '2007-04-01 07:36:58.000000', NULL, 1),
