(3504673, 487245, 5822, '<td valign="top">Even though I''ve just fallen in love, there''s some funky loss of detail to her chest (photographically speaking, of course lol). The skin tones don''t look natural there. Otherwise a very good environmental portrait.</td>', 'Even though I''ve just fallen in love, there''s some funky loss of detail to her chest (photographically speaking, of course lol). The skin tones don''t look natural there. Otherwise a very good environmental portrait.', '2007-04-01 07:58:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3504679, 484906, 5822, '<td valign="top">Very creative abstract out of straws and glass. Colors are good but lighting could be improved. Also, DOF should be deeper, imo, so that all the straws are in focus.</td>', 'Very creative abstract out of straws and glass. Colors are good but lighting could be improved. Also, DOF should be deeper, imo, so that all the straws are in focus.', '2007-04-01 08:03:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3504688, 489673, 5822, '<td valign="top">Very nice composition but looks like you were shooting into the sun and that is difficult and has detracted from the capture, imo. Colors are dull and highlights blown out with some blocked up shadows. Sharpness could be crisper. Tripod?</td>', 'Very nice composition but looks like you were shooting into the sun and that is difficult and has detracted from the capture, imo. Colors are dull and highlights blown out with some blocked up shadows. Sharpness could be crisper. Tripod?', '2007-04-01 08:10:30.000000', NULL, 1),
