(3505828, 485123, 67258, '<td valign="top">I find the pose somewhat awkward, and the model does look rather uncomfortable - may suit the desired result of an advertising shoot, but for a stand-alone photograph (and for this viewer, at any rate) it doesn''t work.  I find my eyes drawn to the hot spot around her left ribs and find it hard to actually define the model''s shape, which is a shame.  A couple of minor niggles, which could have been sorted under the advanced editing rules - a mark in her pubic region, another at the top of her left thigh and some in the shadow under her thumb.</td>', 'I find the pose somewhat awkward, and the model does look rather uncomfortable - may suit the desired result of an advertising shoot, but for a stand-alone photograph (and for this viewer, at any rate) it doesn''t work.  I find my eyes drawn to the hot spot around her left ribs and find it hard to actually define the model''s shape, which is a shame.  A couple of minor niggles, which could have been sorted under the advanced editing rules - a mark in her pubic region, another at the top of her left thigh and some in the shadow under her thumb.', '2007-04-01 15:54:23.000000', NULL, 1),
