(3506218, 490814, 57166, '<td valign="top">I rarely vote below a 7, 6 at times, but even more rare to give a 5.  I am giving it here but I will explain why the best that I can.  To white, way to white.  No clarity, or definable line between one thing and another.  If this is out of the camera it needs processing.... if it''s processed, then, its over processed or something.  This shot did nothing for me, except make me want to go past it.  I am sorry but I had to be honest.   This comment was not intended to mean.  The shot just really turned me off.  Sorry 5</td>', 'I rarely vote below a 7, 6 at times, but even more rare to give a 5.  I am giving it here but I will explain why the best that I can.  To white, way to white.  No clarity, or definable line between one thing and another.  If this is out of the camera it needs processing.... if it''s processed, then, its over processed or something.  This shot did nothing for me, except make me want to go past it.  I am sorry but I had to be honest.   This comment was not intended to mean.  The shot just really turned me off.  Sorry 5', '2007-04-01 17:38:06.000000', NULL, 1),
