(3507838, 479058, 5822, '<td valign="top">Perhaps if I could see the faces of your subjects I would feel a stronger spiritual connection. The blown out sky and drab lighting really detracts from this photo, imo. Poor job of cloing out the footprints in the sand and it appears you have some serious horizon tilt going on, but I could be wrong. Sorry to be so negative.</td>', 'Perhaps if I could see the faces of your subjects I would feel a stronger spiritual connection. The blown out sky and drab lighting really detracts from this photo, imo. Poor job of cloing out the footprints in the sand and it appears you have some serious horizon tilt going on, but I could be wrong. Sorry to be so negative.', '2007-04-01 23:25:09.000000', NULL, 1),
