(3508892, 478788, 36999, '<td valign="top">very cool lighting.  I can''t say much other than I might have like to see the line of the platform &amp; floor be more parallel (or less, just not quite so ''almost'' if that makes sense) to the frame and the leading line of the wall &amp; floor coming in from the left come right out of the corner, but to do that the model would have to move over to the right and the window might not be as cool.  Overall it''s very nice and it''s getting a nice score from me.</td>', 'very cool lighting.  I can''t say much other than I might have like to see the line of the platform & floor be more parallel (or less, just not quite so ''almost'' if that makes sense) to the frame and the leading line of the wall & floor coming in from the left come right out of the corner, but to do that the model would have to move over to the right and the window might not be as cool.  Overall it''s very nice and it''s getting a nice score from me.', '2007-04-02 04:15:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3508907, 486450, 38509, '<td valign="top">excellent photo, a bit to soft ... i would like to see more details of textures, 7</td>', 'excellent photo, a bit to soft ... i would like to see more details of textures, 7', '2007-04-02 04:31:48.000000', NULL, 1),
