(3508959, 485688, 60183, '<td valign="top">it''s a bit hard to tell the ice is on the leaves, they more just look wet.  you might want to concentrate more on the ice next time, or display it in a more obvious way.</td>', 'it''s a bit hard to tell the ice is on the leaves, they more just look wet.  you might want to concentrate more on the ice next time, or display it in a more obvious way.', '2007-04-02 05:22:07.000000', NULL, 1),
