(3508989, 488682, 35545, '<td valign="top">Nice scene and nice processing, but I''d get rid of the few grass stalks in the foreground.  IMNSHO, if you''re going to have them there, you need more of them.  These just look like you forgot to clone them out -- especially that single one at the right.</td>', 'Nice scene and nice processing, but I''d get rid of the few grass stalks in the foreground.  IMNSHO, if you''re going to have them there, you need more of them.  These just look like you forgot to clone them out -- especially that single one at the right.', '2007-04-02 05:43:29.000000', NULL, 1),
