(3510841, 490963, 62787, '<td valign="top">Sexy image! But why, oh why the silly border...? Because the image is B&amp;W, the first thing you see is the coloured border, and it actively distracts from what I consider to be a lovely, sensual image.<br/>I also would have maybe cropped off some of the empty space on the left, I''m not sure it''s actually enhancing the photo.<br/> <br/>Btw - once the challenge is over, if you add a black border copy of this to your portfolio, I''ll add it to my faves.</td>', 'Sexy image! But why, oh why the silly border...? Because the image is B&W, the first thing you see is the coloured border, and it actively distracts from what I consider to be a lovely, sensual image.I also would have maybe cropped off some of the empty space on the left, I''m not sure it''s actually enhancing the photo. Btw - once the challenge is over, if you add a black border copy of this to your portfolio, I''ll add it to my faves.', '2007-04-02 16:57:04.000000', NULL, 1),
