(3511987, 486806, 61651, '<td valign="top">I think this is gorgeous, and has an impressive tonal range.  I wonder though if b&amp;w was the better choice - if there''s a color version of this shot it would be interesting to see it to compare.  Maybe the tonal variation in the foreground shows up in better detail in color; then again, this might be one of those images best viewed on a larger scale and not a little 4x6 box on my screen. :)  In any case, my wondering doesn''t hurt your vote any.  Great shot!</td>', 'I think this is gorgeous, and has an impressive tonal range.  I wonder though if b&w was the better choice - if there''s a color version of this shot it would be interesting to see it to compare.  Maybe the tonal variation in the foreground shows up in better detail in color; then again, this might be one of those images best viewed on a larger scale and not a little 4x6 box on my screen. :)  In any case, my wondering doesn''t hurt your vote any.  Great shot!', '2007-04-02 21:56:50.000000', NULL, 1),
