(3514032, 481501, 71951, '<td valign="top">Great photo. I love seascapes and this is a good one. Just an idea....I would love to see how it looks with a darker, more dramatic sky, you have nice clouds to work with on this one. The sea portion is very dramatic, with the sky being so similar in color it''s taking away from the lower 1/2 of the photo. With the advanced editing on this challege you can do a lot with the sky to balance the drama across the whole photo. Very nice capture though. 8.</td>', 'Great photo. I love seascapes and this is a good one. Just an idea....I would love to see how it looks with a darker, more dramatic sky, you have nice clouds to work with on this one. The sea portion is very dramatic, with the sky being so similar in color it''s taking away from the lower 1/2 of the photo. With the advanced editing on this challege you can do a lot with the sky to balance the drama across the whole photo. Very nice capture though. 8.', '2007-04-03 10:07:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3514036, 486760, 66201, '<td valign="top">Such an incredible setting - enduring landscape for photography. I just think your shaft of light is too strong...the blow out happening at the very top is distracting. The shaft cuts your image into two pieces and looks almost as if someone opened your camera - of traditional Old 35mm mode.</td>', 'Such an incredible setting - enduring landscape for photography. I just think your shaft of light is too strong...the blow out happening at the very top is distracting. The shaft cuts your image into two pieces and looks almost as if someone opened your camera - of traditional Old 35mm mode.', '2007-04-03 10:08:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3514038, 491079, 66241, '<td valign="top">Love this one Jay.... you could have used it in the Still challenge too btw... The water is so still it could almost be frozen.<br/>:)</td>', 'Love this one Jay.... you could have used it in the Still challenge too btw... The water is so still it could almost be frozen.:)', '2007-04-03 10:09:06.000000', NULL, 1),
