(3514153, 490766, 71951, '<td valign="top">Nice composition. I''m guessing you used a Cokin filter on this, which adds to the drama of the sky, however it takes away from the mountains on the right. You can do this same type of affect during PP using layers, without taking away from subject matter (ie. mountains). I find the Cokin split-type filters work best when you have a straigt horizon line.</td>', 'Nice composition. I''m guessing you used a Cokin filter on this, which adds to the drama of the sky, however it takes away from the mountains on the right. You can do this same type of affect during PP using layers, without taking away from subject matter (ie. mountains). I find the Cokin split-type filters work best when you have a straigt horizon line.', '2007-04-03 10:40:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(3514155, 485647, 71951, '<td valign="top">Nice title, I like the contrasting colors.</td>', 'Nice title, I like the contrasting colors.', '2007-04-03 10:41:36.000000', NULL, 1),
