(3514167, 491109, 23877, '<td valign="top">very nice,i have apple bloosomes in the challenge too. some commenter told me that i didn''t meet the challenge.7</td>', 'very nice,i have apple bloosomes in the challenge too. some commenter told me that i didn''t meet the challenge.7', '2007-04-03 10:45:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(3514168, 490232, 41807, '<td valign="top">nice but too far i think it would be more nice if leaf part was seen less.good photo</td>', 'nice but too far i think it would be more nice if leaf part was seen less.good photo', '2007-04-03 10:45:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(3514181, 490885, 71951, '<td valign="top">Great composition and very nice photo. Things to watch out for...your horizon is slightly tilted (look at bridge railing....I use my cropping tool and run it across my photos to check the horizon line). You have great subject matter here and I find the pinkish color of the sky distracts you from it (you''re the photographer though...this is only my opinion). The clarity of the ice and water is great.</td>', 'Great composition and very nice photo. Things to watch out for...your horizon is slightly tilted (look at bridge railing....I use my cropping tool and run it across my photos to check the horizon line). You have great subject matter here and I find the pinkish color of the sky distracts you from it (you''re the photographer though...this is only my opinion). The clarity of the ice and water is great.', '2007-04-03 10:50:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(3514186, 484097, 71951, '<td valign="top">Is that a mean face or what....Great title.</td>', 'Is that a mean face or what....Great title.', '2007-04-03 10:51:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3514188, 491117, 71951, '<td valign="top">Great colors and PP, you expect the fairie folk to come out at any moment. Nice photo.</td>', 'Great colors and PP, you expect the fairie folk to come out at any moment. Nice photo.', '2007-04-03 10:52:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3514190, 491051, 71951, '<td valign="top">Great perspective, Nice capture. Very nice.</td>', 'Great perspective, Nice capture. Very nice.', '2007-04-03 10:53:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(3514218, 483689, 41807, '<td valign="top">nice.if background was light it would be more nice i think. then the photo will look better than now.</td>', 'nice.if background was light it would be more nice i think. then the photo will look better than now.', '2007-04-03 11:03:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(3514220, 487693, 66201, '<td valign="top">Is this in Bath?  Anyway - this has such a 20''s feel about it: you know how fascinated they were with the human form in photography and tried to catch people doing amazing things...obviously it''s a 21st Century pic from the fashions...but it has that look about it. Love it and I love B+W so this gets a happy 8 from me.</td>', 'Is this in Bath?  Anyway - this has such a 20''s feel about it: you know how fascinated they were with the human form in photography and tried to catch people doing amazing things...obviously it''s a 21st Century pic from the fashions...but it has that look about it. Love it and I love B+W so this gets a happy 8 from me.', '2007-04-03 11:04:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3514229, 490882, 66201, '<td valign="top">Such a fascinating subject and a lovely blend of muted tones and subdued patterns. I am longing for some highlight on his face though - even if in part..</td>', 'Such a fascinating subject and a lovely blend of muted tones and subdued patterns. I am longing for some highlight on his face though - even if in part..', '2007-04-03 11:07:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(3514236, 478556, 66201, '<td valign="top">Interesting textures and grains and contrasts.</td>', 'Interesting textures and grains and contrasts.', '2007-04-03 11:09:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(3514241, 490696, 73250, '<td valign="top">Wow...the clouds really worked with you here! Excellent comp.</td>', 'Wow...the clouds really worked with you here! Excellent comp.', '2007-04-03 11:10:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(3514244, 490753, 66201, '<td valign="top">Very beautiful - The violet/purples stand out so beautifully against the brown background of the leaf litter. Lovely crispness of the flowers.</td>', 'Very beautiful - The violet/purples stand out so beautifully against the brown background of the leaf litter. Lovely crispness of the flowers.', '2007-04-03 11:11:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(3514246, 490433, 73250, '<td valign="top">I like this...but, would have positioned the other person a bit different. The man looks as if something is growing out of his shoulder.</td>', 'I like this...but, would have positioned the other person a bit different. The man looks as if something is growing out of his shoulder.', '2007-04-03 11:11:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3514248, 490538, 73250, '<td valign="top">Very well seen...excellent composition.</td>', 'Very well seen...excellent composition.', '2007-04-03 11:12:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(3514249, 488523, 66201, '<td valign="top">So stark and sterile: their nakedness against the clinical lines of the mall make this quite Science Fictionish. The B+W well suited to the composition.</td>', 'So stark and sterile: their nakedness against the clinical lines of the mall make this quite Science Fictionish. The B+W well suited to the composition.', '2007-04-03 11:12:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3514253, 486301, 66201, '<td valign="top">So Darling. What a lovely combination of characters and a beautiful natural capture: the tousled hair and unbuttoned shirt are perfect. Love the sepia and grain too. So much charm.</td>', 'So Darling. What a lovely combination of characters and a beautiful natural capture: the tousled hair and unbuttoned shirt are perfect. Love the sepia and grain too. So much charm.', '2007-04-03 11:14:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(3514254, 484147, 73250, '<td valign="top">Well done.</td>', 'Well done.', '2007-04-03 11:14:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3514259, 484906, 73250, '<td valign="top">Nice focus and color.</td>', 'Nice focus and color.', '2007-04-03 11:17:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(3514265, 489327, 39144, '<td valign="top">This is a lovely photograph, but I really don''t see poverty in it. The photo is way too clean for that. His skin is smooth, clean and without blemish. His hair is well kept. With that said, this is still an excellent portrait, the title just doesn''t fit it.</td>', 'This is a lovely photograph, but I really don''t see poverty in it. The photo is way too clean for that. His skin is smooth, clean and without blemish. His hair is well kept. With that said, this is still an excellent portrait, the title just doesn''t fit it.', '2007-04-03 11:19:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3514268, 491010, 73250, '<td valign="top">Excellent tones and composition. 9</td>', 'Excellent tones and composition. 9', '2007-04-03 11:20:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3514270, 483238, 73250, '<td valign="top">I love the composition and the treatment.</td>', 'I love the composition and the treatment.', '2007-04-03 11:21:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(3514271, 490096, 39144, '<td valign="top">This photo is just too busy to really make this group portrait effective. Either limiting the DOF or moving them out to the beach would have probably been better. The on-camera flash is apparent with everyone as well. It''s nice to have the flash to fill the shadows in the middle of the day but I don''t find them very effective at lighting up a subject.</td>', 'This photo is just too busy to really make this group portrait effective. Either limiting the DOF or moving them out to the beach would have probably been better. The on-camera flash is apparent with everyone as well. It''s nice to have the flash to fill the shadows in the middle of the day but I don''t find them very effective at lighting up a subject.', '2007-04-03 11:21:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3514273, 487101, 73250, '<td valign="top">I really like this...8</td>', 'I really like this...8', '2007-04-03 11:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3514275, 490295, 39144, '<td valign="top">Wow! I love the green landscape of this photo mixed with the red/grey clouds above. Nice work! The low angle of lighting really helps to define the landscape.</td>', 'Wow! I love the green landscape of this photo mixed with the red/grey clouds above. Nice work! The low angle of lighting really helps to define the landscape.', '2007-04-03 11:22:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3514278, 487693, 39144, '<td valign="top">Awesome street photography. The balance between the dancer and the crowd and the building is perfect. Nice work.</td>', 'Awesome street photography. The balance between the dancer and the crowd and the building is perfect. Nice work.', '2007-04-03 11:23:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(3514280, 490472, 39144, '<td valign="top">Theis portrait lacks some good contrast to really make it stand out, and the background is kind of distracting.</td>', 'Theis portrait lacks some good contrast to really make it stand out, and the background is kind of distracting.', '2007-04-03 11:24:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3514319, 490700, 68956, '<td valign="top">A lot of noise in the shadows.</td>', 'A lot of noise in the shadows.', '2007-04-03 11:38:33.000000', NULL, 1),
