(3514566, 486521, 60614, '<td valign="top">Awwwww!  This little Tamarin is sooooo cute.  Great bokeh.  Nice crisp focus and composition.  I love this little guys fur.  You have caught the softness of the fur but yet it is crisp.  The colors blend together beautifully.  One of my favorites in this challenge.</td>', 'Awwwww!  This little Tamarin is sooooo cute.  Great bokeh.  Nice crisp focus and composition.  I love this little guys fur.  You have caught the softness of the fur but yet it is crisp.  The colors blend together beautifully.  One of my favorites in this challenge.', '2007-04-03 12:53:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3514568, 488897, 2223, '<td valign="top">Just love this, bumping to 10</td>', 'Just love this, bumping to 10', '2007-04-03 12:53:57.000000', NULL, 1),
