(3515033, 478854, 32378, '<td valign="top">I like the idea, but not crazy about the angle of everything including the towers on the horizon.</td>', 'I like the idea, but not crazy about the angle of everything including the towers on the horizon.', '2007-04-03 15:28:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(3515034, 482294, 66201, '<td valign="top">Very beautiful - I find the heavy border at top and bottom too "heavy" for the delicacy of the image. I would have preferred a more subtle black border all round. It just tends to pull my eye away from the swan (which is where it''s really wanting to go to).</td>', 'Very beautiful - I find the heavy border at top and bottom too "heavy" for the delicacy of the image. I would have preferred a more subtle black border all round. It just tends to pull my eye away from the swan (which is where it''s really wanting to go to).', '2007-04-03 15:29:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(3515037, 488336, 66201, '<td valign="top">Glorious.</td>', 'Glorious.', '2007-04-03 15:29:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(3515042, 490902, 32378, '<td valign="top">I like this, the only comment is the bright petal on the lower left tends to make my eye bounce back and forth between each side of the picture.</td>', 'I like this, the only comment is the bright petal on the lower left tends to make my eye bounce back and forth between each side of the picture.', '2007-04-03 15:30:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(3515048, 485612, 66201, '<td valign="top">Lovely in sepia - very delicate.</td>', 'Lovely in sepia - very delicate.', '2007-04-03 15:31:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3515055, 489034, 32378, '<td valign="top">There is a tint to the color in this that I find distracting, perhaps it is from the harsh lighting.</td>', 'There is a tint to the color in this that I find distracting, perhaps it is from the harsh lighting.', '2007-04-03 15:34:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3515056, 484416, 32378, '<td valign="top">Lovely shot, shooting in the fog is always a challenge.</td>', 'Lovely shot, shooting in the fog is always a challenge.', '2007-04-03 15:34:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(3515062, 486226, 32378, '<td valign="top">I like the concept alot. Seems to be a yellow tint in the flowers, would have liked them to have deeper color.</td>', 'I like the concept alot. Seems to be a yellow tint in the flowers, would have liked them to have deeper color.', '2007-04-03 15:36:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(3515071, 484566, 43774, '<td valign="top">that''s pretty amazing</td>', 'that''s pretty amazing', '2007-04-03 15:41:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(3515072, 490130, 32378, '<td valign="top">I like the composition with the bush in the foreground, dam in the center and towers off in the distance.  The subject seems very busy though.  I''m guessing this was shot mid day from the bluish light I think softer light would make this score better.</td>', 'I like the composition with the bush in the foreground, dam in the center and towers off in the distance.  The subject seems very busy though.  I''m guessing this was shot mid day from the bluish light I think softer light would make this score better.', '2007-04-03 15:41:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(3515086, 482655, 32378, '<td valign="top">Nice picutre, perhaps an angle where he was looking a little more towards the camera would add some impact.</td>', 'Nice picutre, perhaps an angle where he was looking a little more towards the camera would add some impact.', '2007-04-03 15:46:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(3515088, 490905, 32378, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot, I like the light in the hands.</td>', 'Very nice shot, I like the light in the hands.', '2007-04-03 15:47:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(3515102, 484042, 32378, '<td valign="top">Composition is good, although not the most interesting of subjects.  Lighting feels very harsh.</td>', 'Composition is good, although not the most interesting of subjects.  Lighting feels very harsh.', '2007-04-03 15:52:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(3515105, 490946, 32378, '<td valign="top">I like the softness of this.  Well done.</td>', 'I like the softness of this.  Well done.', '2007-04-03 15:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3515119, 491137, 32378, '<td valign="top">This would be a lovely picture if shot at a different time of day with side lighting to give the formations more texture.  Also I''d remove some of the sky since there is nothing of interest there.</td>', 'This would be a lovely picture if shot at a different time of day with side lighting to give the formations more texture.  Also I''d remove some of the sky since there is nothing of interest there.', '2007-04-03 16:00:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3515124, 489554, 32378, '<td valign="top">Good sharp focus.  Lighting is a little harsh.</td>', 'Good sharp focus.  Lighting is a little harsh.', '2007-04-03 16:00:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(3515144, 487544, 32378, '<td valign="top">Outstanding shot.</td>', 'Outstanding shot.', '2007-04-03 16:11:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3515147, 488982, 32378, '<td valign="top">Good shot.  I like the composition and detail in the bird.  I also like the how the color of the background pulls out the little bit of orange in the bird.</td>', 'Good shot.  I like the composition and detail in the bird.  I also like the how the color of the background pulls out the little bit of orange in the bird.', '2007-04-03 16:13:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3515151, 490303, 32378, '<td valign="top">I like the idea and lighting.  I think this would have been better with the foreground stairs is sharper focus.</td>', 'I like the idea and lighting.  I think this would have been better with the foreground stairs is sharper focus.', '2007-04-03 16:14:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(3515152, 490905, 35895, '<td valign="top">excellent!</td>', 'excellent!', '2007-04-03 16:15:15.000000', NULL, 1),
