(3515419, 478695, 58473, '<td valign="top">Cool shot. I like the B &amp; W.</td>', 'Cool shot. I like the B & W.', '2007-04-03 18:04:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3515421, 478071, 58473, '<td valign="top">Beauty action shot.</td>', 'Beauty action shot.', '2007-04-03 18:04:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(3515422, 490659, 24454, '<td valign="top">Look at that look on his face.  Ohhhhh he looks like he wants to, doesn''t he?  This is a very cute moment captured.</td>', 'Look at that look on his face.  Ohhhhh he looks like he wants to, doesn''t he?  This is a very cute moment captured.', '2007-04-03 18:04:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3515425, 484602, 58473, '<td valign="top">Great expression.Beauty capture.</td>', 'Great expression.Beauty capture.', '2007-04-03 18:07:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3515427, 487542, 24454, '<td valign="top">How pretty.  No. . .GORGEOUS!  The contrast and rich processing are exquisite.  I love those golden grasses against that midnight blue water.  This is truly one of the few really really WOW pictures I''ve seen so far.</td>', 'How pretty.  No. . .GORGEOUS!  The contrast and rich processing are exquisite.  I love those golden grasses against that midnight blue water.  This is truly one of the few really really WOW pictures I''ve seen so far.', '2007-04-03 18:07:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(3515429, 490890, 24454, '<td valign="top">This is very pretty.  It''s has such dramatic shapes!  But the still water and those mirror reflections are just gorgeous.</td>', 'This is very pretty.  It''s has such dramatic shapes!  But the still water and those mirror reflections are just gorgeous.', '2007-04-03 18:09:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(3515431, 491153, 58473, '<td valign="top">Beauty colors. Great job.</td>', 'Beauty colors. Great job.', '2007-04-03 18:10:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(3515434, 487544, 58473, '<td valign="top">Very nice capture.</td>', 'Very nice capture.', '2007-04-03 18:12:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(3515443, 489585, 58473, '<td valign="top">Beauty stop action.</td>', 'Beauty stop action.', '2007-04-03 18:14:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(3515448, 489625, 66353, '<td valign="top">A less busy background would have been nice</td>', 'A less busy background would have been nice', '2007-04-03 18:17:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(3515449, 491131, 43774, '<td valign="top">Very nice</td>', 'Very nice', '2007-04-03 18:17:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3515452, 490844, 24454, '<td valign="top">I really love photos like this that show the very slow dreamy water.  This one is especially nice because the processing on teh grass is so tack sharp and rich.  It looks barren and desolate. . .yet gorgeous.</td>', 'I really love photos like this that show the very slow dreamy water.  This one is especially nice because the processing on teh grass is so tack sharp and rich.  It looks barren and desolate. . .yet gorgeous.', '2007-04-03 18:18:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3515454, 491138, 66353, '<td valign="top">Beautiful :) Excellent light and colours...</td>', 'Beautiful :) Excellent light and colours...', '2007-04-03 18:19:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(3515457, 484313, 43774, '<td valign="top">Interesting composition. Not sure about the one moving crystal. I think the B&amp;W is ok but seems a bit dull, could use some contrast.</td>', 'Interesting composition. Not sure about the one moving crystal. I think the B&W is ok but seems a bit dull, could use some contrast.', '2007-04-03 18:20:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(3515460, 484097, 66353, '<td valign="top">Neat :) Excellent post processing...</td>', 'Neat :) Excellent post processing...', '2007-04-03 18:21:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3515464, 482315, 66353, '<td valign="top">Reminds me of a Magritte painting :)</td>', 'Reminds me of a Magritte painting :)', '2007-04-03 18:22:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3515465, 491118, 24454, '<td valign="top">I love photos like this.  The old, old brick and door are so striking, and your processing is perfect to enhance the rich feel to this photo.</td>', 'I love photos like this.  The old, old brick and door are so striking, and your processing is perfect to enhance the rich feel to this photo.', '2007-04-03 18:22:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(3515467, 490888, 66353, '<td valign="top">Sorry...   your post processing doesn''t work for me.</td>', 'Sorry...   your post processing doesn''t work for me.', '2007-04-03 18:22:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3515470, 490501, 24454, '<td valign="top">Wow. . .this one sure is packed with emotion and a powerful tug on the heart strings!  What a beautiful scene this is!</td>', 'Wow. . .this one sure is packed with emotion and a powerful tug on the heart strings!  What a beautiful scene this is!', '2007-04-03 18:24:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(3515472, 489354, 51597, '<td valign="top">exceptional...</td>', 'exceptional...', '2007-04-03 18:25:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3515473, 491049, 53316, '<td valign="top">Wow. Very nice crop.  And I love the depth of focus here. It''s not from front to back but side to side (if that makes sense) and it blurs the background quite nicely without making me think "oh gosh another small DOF just because it''s a macro shot". Personally I wish more of the spider had been in focus but I think that''s just personal preference and quite minor really.</td>', 'Wow. Very nice crop.  And I love the depth of focus here. It''s not from front to back but side to side (if that makes sense) and it blurs the background quite nicely without making me think "oh gosh another small DOF just because it''s a macro shot". Personally I wish more of the spider had been in focus but I think that''s just personal preference and quite minor really.', '2007-04-03 18:25:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3515475, 485517, 51597, '<td valign="top">I love birds .. Nice job..</td>', 'I love birds .. Nice job..', '2007-04-03 18:25:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3515476, 488982, 24454, '<td valign="top">Wow!  Now THAT is a standout bird picture!  I never ever get tired of stunning photography. . .even tho there are quite a few bird pictures in this challenge. . .this one stands out takes my breath away.  It''s the colors.  And the detail and razor sharp texture!  It is AWESOME!</td>', 'Wow!  Now THAT is a standout bird picture!  I never ever get tired of stunning photography. . .even tho there are quite a few bird pictures in this challenge. . .this one stands out takes my breath away.  It''s the colors.  And the detail and razor sharp texture!  It is AWESOME!', '2007-04-03 18:26:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(3515478, 490451, 66353, '<td valign="top">Nice post processing...<br/>I wish you had cropped the top a little and made the horisontal beam touch the frame. The green from the tree is a distraction as the rest of the picture is red/brown in tone...</td>', 'Nice post processing...I wish you had cropped the top a little and made the horisontal beam touch the frame. The green from the tree is a distraction as the rest of the picture is red/brown in tone...', '2007-04-03 18:26:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3515479, 489036, 51597, '<td valign="top">Wow!.. It''s a great view gives one a sense of direction..</td>', 'Wow!.. It''s a great view gives one a sense of direction..', '2007-04-03 18:26:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(3515480, 485813, 66353, '<td valign="top">:) funny</td>', ':) funny', '2007-04-03 18:27:25.000000', NULL, 1),
