(3516644, 489337, 42495, '<td valign="top">Good job on your leading line of the bridge.  I will offer a couple suggestions that may make it more appealing, at least for me.  Your vanishing point is nearly dead center, I would try to use the rule of thirds here a bit more.  Also, your horizon is tilted down towards the right.  Last suggestion - use all of the 640 pixels dpc allows insead of 600.  Good luck!</td>', 'Good job on your leading line of the bridge.  I will offer a couple suggestions that may make it more appealing, at least for me.  Your vanishing point is nearly dead center, I would try to use the rule of thirds here a bit more.  Also, your horizon is tilted down towards the right.  Last suggestion - use all of the 640 pixels dpc allows insead of 600.  Good luck!', '2007-04-04 00:14:36.000000', NULL, 1),
