(3518540, 484058, 73725, '<td valign="top">This has a great feel to it.  The texture of the building, sky, colors, and exposure all combine to make an excellent image.  I wonder if some correction to the converging verticles would take this from excellent to outstanding.</td>', 'This has a great feel to it.  The texture of the building, sky, colors, and exposure all combine to make an excellent image.  I wonder if some correction to the converging verticles would take this from excellent to outstanding.', '2007-04-04 12:13:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(3518548, 489145, 73725, '<td valign="top">Beautiful composition and colors.  Where is this wonderful spot? I might have tried to rotate the image slightly in the counter clockwise direction.</td>', 'Beautiful composition and colors.  Where is this wonderful spot? I might have tried to rotate the image slightly in the counter clockwise direction.', '2007-04-04 12:16:06.000000', NULL, 1),
