(3519411, 489663, 39144, '<td valign="top">This is a nice high-key photo. I''m not too sure about the selective desaturation yet though. I think it is effective because I''m sure pink wouldn''t turn out too well in grayscale, but I just don''t know if I like the limited colors in this. Perhaps blending the grayscale layer in to the color layer a little so the skin had just a hint of color would make the pink feel more natural.</td>', 'This is a nice high-key photo. I''m not too sure about the selective desaturation yet though. I think it is effective because I''m sure pink wouldn''t turn out too well in grayscale, but I just don''t know if I like the limited colors in this. Perhaps blending the grayscale layer in to the color layer a little so the skin had just a hint of color would make the pink feel more natural.', '2007-04-04 16:11:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3519417, 488090, 39144, '<td valign="top">Man! I wish this photo was just a bit sharper or something. The lighting, colors, and highlights, along with the shapes, really make this photo stand out. My attention is locked in to the photo. But as I study it more, trying to find some detail, I get lost in it. Still, it is an amazing shot.</td>', 'Man! I wish this photo was just a bit sharper or something. The lighting, colors, and highlights, along with the shapes, really make this photo stand out. My attention is locked in to the photo. But as I study it more, trying to find some detail, I get lost in it. Still, it is an amazing shot.', '2007-04-04 16:12:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(3519419, 480874, 33352, '<td valign="top">Good composition and color....</td>', 'Good composition and color....', '2007-04-04 16:13:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3519421, 490233, 56502, '<td valign="top">Deja vu ;-) <br/>(Still challenge - I like this one as well)</td>', 'Deja vu ;-) (Still challenge - I like this one as well)', '2007-04-04 16:13:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(3519425, 488146, 39144, '<td valign="top">I know some people are really in to the heavy PP here but I find it more of a turnoff. The pose on this shot is OK but the PP is overdone.</td>', 'I know some people are really in to the heavy PP here but I find it more of a turnoff. The pose on this shot is OK but the PP is overdone.', '2007-04-04 16:13:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(3519431, 490469, 39144, '<td valign="top">The angle of this photo is perfect. The lighting is a little flat. There are sharpening artifacts along the edge of the trees. Probably a little less sharpening and a little selective work in the levels and curves and this photo would stand out much more.</td>', 'The angle of this photo is perfect. The lighting is a little flat. There are sharpening artifacts along the edge of the trees. Probably a little less sharpening and a little selective work in the levels and curves and this photo would stand out much more.', '2007-04-04 16:15:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(3519434, 490456, 33352, '<td valign="top">Awesome capture,can almost hear the brain working...</td>', 'Awesome capture,can almost hear the brain working...', '2007-04-04 16:15:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3519439, 491004, 39144, '<td valign="top">This is one of those times when breaking the rules really pays off. I love the centered composition on this shot. And the contrast between the clouds and sky, and hill and water is awesome! Nice work.</td>', 'This is one of those times when breaking the rules really pays off. I love the centered composition on this shot. And the contrast between the clouds and sky, and hill and water is awesome! Nice work.', '2007-04-04 16:17:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3519443, 490576, 39144, '<td valign="top">AMAZING! How do you accomplish this? A well-lit foreground, a sunsetting sky, and a dark, star-lit night? This is one of the best photos I have ever seen.</td>', 'AMAZING! How do you accomplish this? A well-lit foreground, a sunsetting sky, and a dark, star-lit night? This is one of the best photos I have ever seen.', '2007-04-04 16:19:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3519447, 485612, 39144, '<td valign="top">Another top 10 photo for sure. Nice work!</td>', 'Another top 10 photo for sure. Nice work!', '2007-04-04 16:19:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(3519449, 486756, 56502, '<td valign="top">Funny idea.</td>', 'Funny idea.', '2007-04-04 16:20:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(3519450, 487194, 33352, '<td valign="top">Good effect...</td>', 'Good effect...', '2007-04-04 16:20:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3519461, 484230, 70514, '<td valign="top">Wow!  Great blending of the two, what an angle!</td>', 'Wow!  Great blending of the two, what an angle!', '2007-04-04 16:23:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3519484, 487776, 208, '<td valign="top">The statue is too washed out. The sky blends right in with the right shoulder. The exposure is better on the trees on the right side.</td>', 'The statue is too washed out. The sky blends right in with the right shoulder. The exposure is better on the trees on the right side.', '2007-04-04 16:30:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3519488, 489740, 208, '<td valign="top">great dynamic black and white (and insert sensor dust joke here)</td>', 'great dynamic black and white (and insert sensor dust joke here)', '2007-04-04 16:33:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(3519494, 491121, 208, '<td valign="top">The colors are nice, and the focus is right where it should be, but it still seems a little bland. Maybe it''s the lighting? Maybe the pistil is too centered?</td>', 'The colors are nice, and the focus is right where it should be, but it still seems a little bland. Maybe it''s the lighting? Maybe the pistil is too centered?', '2007-04-04 16:36:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(3519503, 489087, 208, '<td valign="top">Without knowing what that thing in the middle is, it''s just a distraction. Make it a tree, a person, <i>something</i> - and this is a more interesting photo.</td>', 'Without knowing what that thing in the middle is, it''s just a distraction. Make it a tree, a person, something - and this is a more interesting photo.', '2007-04-04 16:39:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(3519515, 490701, 208, '<td valign="top">The more I look at it, the more I like it. The silhouette makes for a great Everyman look. The light lines all point straight at him. He stands out even more by cutting off the verticals of the entryways. And then the "Arrivals" sign is a great touch.</td>', 'The more I look at it, the more I like it. The silhouette makes for a great Everyman look. The light lines all point straight at him. He stands out even more by cutting off the verticals of the entryways. And then the "Arrivals" sign is a great touch.', '2007-04-04 16:42:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(3519569, 480996, 70661, '<td valign="top">I really like this type of processing. I like the colors also. The girl looks so out of place here but yet she fits right in. Makes me want to sit here and figure out the whole story of why she''s where she is. 10</td>', 'I really like this type of processing. I like the colors also. The girl looks so out of place here but yet she fits right in. Makes me want to sit here and figure out the whole story of why she''s where she is. 10', '2007-04-04 16:57:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3519578, 491010, 70661, '<td valign="top">I think this deserves a ribbon. 10</td>', 'I think this deserves a ribbon. 10', '2007-04-04 16:59:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(3519582, 481913, 70661, '<td valign="top">So clear and crisp and the colors so vibrant! Great shot.</td>', 'So clear and crisp and the colors so vibrant! Great shot.', '2007-04-04 17:00:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3519585, 487101, 70661, '<td valign="top">One of my favorites! Excellent capture! 10</td>', 'One of my favorites! Excellent capture! 10', '2007-04-04 17:00:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3519588, 488146, 208, '<td valign="top">Great shot - love the stillness of the face and the movement of the hand. The cigarette is a nice touch, too.</td>', 'Great shot - love the stillness of the face and the movement of the hand. The cigarette is a nice touch, too.', '2007-04-04 17:01:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(3519589, 491093, 70661, '<td valign="top">Love the textures! Very nice. 10</td>', 'Love the textures! Very nice. 10', '2007-04-04 17:01:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3519599, 490472, 208, '<td valign="top">Is this a duotone? Or a black and white with color added? I think it''s a poor color choice, especially for his skin. The focus is nice and sharp, and the expression is a nice capture - maybe crop it tighter to his face.</td>', 'Is this a duotone? Or a black and white with color added? I think it''s a poor color choice, especially for his skin. The focus is nice and sharp, and the expression is a nice capture - maybe crop it tighter to his face.', '2007-04-04 17:03:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(3519605, 488755, 66241, '<td valign="top">Awesome shot... all the way down to the drool!</td>', 'Awesome shot... all the way down to the drool!', '2007-04-04 17:04:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3519607, 490652, 208, '<td valign="top">I admit I''m not very good with lighting, but it looks like the fill flash is too bright - the girl is a bit washed out and the shadow on the grass is pretty bad. It''s a lovely background (if a bit tilted) and a nice snapshot for the family album.</td>', 'I admit I''m not very good with lighting, but it looks like the fill flash is too bright - the girl is a bit washed out and the shadow on the grass is pretty bad. It''s a lovely background (if a bit tilted) and a nice snapshot for the family album.', '2007-04-04 17:05:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(3519620, 490504, 208, '<td valign="top">Cool macro, but I wish it were doing something more than just going up and down across the screen. A more interesting/dramatic angle would help.</td>', 'Cool macro, but I wish it were doing something more than just going up and down across the screen. A more interesting/dramatic angle would help.', '2007-04-04 17:11:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(3519676, 489798, 5822, '<td valign="top">It''s a beautiful scene but a bit flat, imo. Contrast needs to be punched up a little, especially the snow, which appears too gray. Probably could have used another 2/3rds stop of light when exposing as the brightness of snow combined with angle of sun to camera caused some underexposure.</td>', 'It''s a beautiful scene but a bit flat, imo. Contrast needs to be punched up a little, especially the snow, which appears too gray. Probably could have used another 2/3rds stop of light when exposing as the brightness of snow combined with angle of sun to camera caused some underexposure.', '2007-04-04 17:30:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3519679, 485813, 39880, '<td valign="top">That''s funny.  Nice capture.</td>', 'That''s funny.  Nice capture.', '2007-04-04 17:31:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3519682, 487101, 39880, '<td valign="top">Nice shot.</td>', 'Nice shot.', '2007-04-04 17:32:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3519716, 488360, 44877, '<td valign="top">Beautiful clarity. The light/dark contrast is awesome, as are the colors. Interesting photo.</td>', 'Beautiful clarity. The light/dark contrast is awesome, as are the colors. Interesting photo.', '2007-04-04 17:44:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(3519739, 488500, 5822, '<td valign="top">Good pose, I like that it looks like he''s holding up the lion statue. Torso appears too soft, maybe too much noise reduction? I also like the blurred background but feel the white shirt is out of place and borders on overexposure. Aspect ratio could have been a bit wider to include all of his right hand and knee.</td>', 'Good pose, I like that it looks like he''s holding up the lion statue. Torso appears too soft, maybe too much noise reduction? I also like the blurred background but feel the white shirt is out of place and borders on overexposure. Aspect ratio could have been a bit wider to include all of his right hand and knee.', '2007-04-04 17:50:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(3519768, 491053, 75617, '<td valign="top">This is a very detailed pic! Its great! Good luck!</td>', 'This is a very detailed pic! Its great! Good luck!', '2007-04-04 18:00:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(3519769, 489606, 75617, '<td valign="top">The focus is good! Nice job!</td>', 'The focus is good! Nice job!', '2007-04-04 18:01:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(3519772, 490293, 75617, '<td valign="top">This is beautiful!</td>', 'This is beautiful!', '2007-04-04 18:01:55.000000', NULL, 1),
