(3522538, 490926, 67844, '<td valign="top">This photo would benefit greatly from some tone mapping. It would really show the depth in the clouds as well as give everything more texture. I would like to see a little more of the tree and the building. Maybe it would have been better in portrait orientation.</td>', 'This photo would benefit greatly from some tone mapping. It would really show the depth in the clouds as well as give everything more texture. I would like to see a little more of the tree and the building. Maybe it would have been better in portrait orientation.', '2007-04-05 15:03:20.000000', NULL, 1),
