(3522651, 491159, 208, '<td valign="top">This is a great portrait. His personality really comes through here. I like the balance of the frame, with the hoop cut off on the right. His head looks a little disembodied and off to the right in the hood, but it might be a function of the fill light, which lights him up nicely.</td>', 'This is a great portrait. His personality really comes through here. I like the balance of the frame, with the hoop cut off on the right. His head looks a little disembodied and off to the right in the hood, but it might be a function of the fill light, which lights him up nicely.', '2007-04-05 15:56:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(3522658, 486064, 208, '<td valign="top">While the grungy look is great for her and the background, I wonder if the postman should be a little cleaner and brighter. The yellow in the back leads my eyes right to her (not that I''m complaining), but she''s out of focus.</td>', 'While the grungy look is great for her and the background, I wonder if the postman should be a little cleaner and brighter. The yellow in the back leads my eyes right to her (not that I''m complaining), but she''s out of focus.', '2007-04-05 15:59:50.000000', NULL, 1),
