(3522704, 490814, 208, '<td valign="top">This is right on the line of photography and a photographic illustration (more than digital art, I think), but it works for me. I''d like to see a bit more detail in the herd - faces, maybe - but seeing the snow on their backs is a great capture. Love the negative space, too.</td>', 'This is right on the line of photography and a photographic illustration (more than digital art, I think), but it works for me. I''d like to see a bit more detail in the herd - faces, maybe - but seeing the snow on their backs is a great capture. Love the negative space, too.', '2007-04-05 16:08:04.000000', NULL, 1),
