(3522740, 490501, 63269, '<td valign="top">Very good shot! It tells a story of it''s own... the composition is lovely too, and the moon adds the perfect touch. It''s too bad the moon can''t be larger - but I know how frustrating that is myself, after trying to photograph something with the moon. It''s just too far away! ;)</td>', 'Very good shot! It tells a story of it''s own... the composition is lovely too, and the moon adds the perfect touch. It''s too bad the moon can''t be larger - but I know how frustrating that is myself, after trying to photograph something with the moon. It''s just too far away! ;)', '2007-04-05 16:14:02.000000', NULL, 1),
