(3522762, 484313, 208, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure I like the effect of the swinging thing. I''ve done something similar, but it was with an object that''s supposed to have movement; I''m not sure this is. I do like the framing, though - how the lamp is off-centered.</td>', 'I''m not sure I like the effect of the swinging thing. I''ve done something similar, but it was with an object that''s supposed to have movement; I''m not sure this is. I do like the framing, though - how the lamp is off-centered.', '2007-04-05 16:19:47.000000', NULL, 1),
