(3522772, 479954, 63269, '<td valign="top">A really cool idea for a shot - and pretty good! However, I would suggest putting a little bit more composition into the photo... and maybe trying to get some more details. For example, even though the baby''s hand has some good detail, the hand in the back is sort of missing out, making me want to see more of it as well. A sweet photo though! :)</td>', 'A really cool idea for a shot - and pretty good! However, I would suggest putting a little bit more composition into the photo... and maybe trying to get some more details. For example, even though the baby''s hand has some good detail, the hand in the back is sort of missing out, making me want to see more of it as well. A sweet photo though! :)', '2007-04-05 16:24:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(3522778, 480996, 63269, '<td valign="top">Wow, this is truely awesome! My only complaint is that the subject almost feels like she''s being shoved off to the corner of the shot... Maybe if she were positioned a little closer to the center, and facing a different dirrection... but I''m just being picky. This is one amazing portrait! Good luck on the challenge!</td>', 'Wow, this is truely awesome! My only complaint is that the subject almost feels like she''s being shoved off to the corner of the shot... Maybe if she were positioned a little closer to the center, and facing a different dirrection... but I''m just being picky. This is one amazing portrait! Good luck on the challenge!', '2007-04-05 16:26:01.000000', NULL, 1),
