(3522790, 490472, 63269, '<td valign="top">Well, here''s my two cents. :)<br/>I like the sepia, but it almost feels a little bit green - I have that problem to, but I''ve found that desaturating a littl bit usually helps that. And then I might also suggest cropping a little more. He does have a great smile, but the writting on the shirt kind of distracts the viewer away from that a little. Otherwise, it''s a great shot!</td>', 'Well, here''s my two cents. :)I like the sepia, but it almost feels a little bit green - I have that problem to, but I''ve found that desaturating a littl bit usually helps that. And then I might also suggest cropping a little more. He does have a great smile, but the writting on the shirt kind of distracts the viewer away from that a little. Otherwise, it''s a great shot!', '2007-04-05 16:32:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3522791, 488840, 63269, '<td valign="top">Awesome capture!</td>', 'Awesome capture!', '2007-04-05 16:32:54.000000', NULL, 1),
