(3523258, 487472, 57032, '<td valign="top">Very impressive shot. A bit of blur in the peak of the nose, but those eyes are piercing, and excellent feather detail below the beak.</td>', 'Very impressive shot. A bit of blur in the peak of the nose, but those eyes are piercing, and excellent feather detail below the beak.', '2007-04-05 18:47:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(3523266, 491034, 68956, '<td valign="top">Nicely composed</td>', 'Nicely composed', '2007-04-05 18:49:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3523285, 490847, 63269, '<td valign="top">Cool, I love how crisp and clear everything is!</td>', 'Cool, I love how crisp and clear everything is!', '2007-04-05 18:51:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(3523288, 490295, 69684, '<td valign="top">Beuatiful lightning!</td>', 'Beuatiful lightning!', '2007-04-05 18:52:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(3523445, 489494, 66384, '<td valign="top">Beautiful clarity and color. Fantastic capture.</td>', 'Beautiful clarity and color. Fantastic capture.', '2007-04-05 19:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3523473, 484615, 68947, '<td valign="top">You know, I love this type of editing.  I wish that people in here were more tolerant of it.  That''s the entire reason we have editing software so that we can be creative with it.  Otherwise, we''d simply take out our 35 mm cameras and shoot.  I like this one!  But, unfortunately, I have a feeling (through experience) that this type of editing will likely lower your score.  HUGS and good marks from me!</td>', 'You know, I love this type of editing.  I wish that people in here were more tolerant of it.  That''s the entire reason we have editing software so that we can be creative with it.  Otherwise, we''d simply take out our 35 mm cameras and shoot.  I like this one!  But, unfortunately, I have a feeling (through experience) that this type of editing will likely lower your score.  HUGS and good marks from me!', '2007-04-05 19:58:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(3523476, 480629, 68947, '<td valign="top">This is gonna get the "snapshot" comments from the voters here.  I can feel them coming! *grin*  Love the "candid" style of this shot.  Makes me wnt to have fun too!</td>', 'This is gonna get the "snapshot" comments from the voters here.  I can feel them coming! *grin*  Love the "candid" style of this shot.  Makes me wnt to have fun too!', '2007-04-05 19:59:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(3523479, 487544, 68947, '<td valign="top">Oh, wouldn''t I LOVE to be right there!!!!  Nice shot</td>', 'Oh, wouldn''t I LOVE to be right there!!!!  Nice shot', '2007-04-05 20:00:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(3523483, 487533, 68947, '<td valign="top">I really get the idea of this shot and like it!  I''m wondering if perhaps, having the background with a tad less opacity might have helped bring out the wire more???</td>', 'I really get the idea of this shot and like it!  I''m wondering if perhaps, having the background with a tad less opacity might have helped bring out the wire more???', '2007-04-05 20:02:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(3523491, 479991, 68947, '<td valign="top">Bet HE gets the Ladies'' votes rather than the shot itself!!! *grin*</td>', 'Bet HE gets the Ladies'' votes rather than the shot itself!!! *grin*', '2007-04-05 20:05:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3523495, 491093, 68947, '<td valign="top">Wow, I love the editing to this one!  I wish more would accept this type of thing, but alas, it seems the voters in this site seem to love the pure "photo style" and don''t allow much room for the creative editing.  Personally, I REALLY like this!  8!!!</td>', 'Wow, I love the editing to this one!  I wish more would accept this type of thing, but alas, it seems the voters in this site seem to love the pure "photo style" and don''t allow much room for the creative editing.  Personally, I REALLY like this!  8!!!', '2007-04-05 20:07:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3523500, 487765, 68947, '<td valign="top">You know, the editing in this makes it something to catch attention, but unfortunately, it''s been my experience that a lot of voters in this site just don''t like the "edited look" which really doesn''t make sense since we all have this really cool editing capabilities. Nicely done in my estimation!</td>', 'You know, the editing in this makes it something to catch attention, but unfortunately, it''s been my experience that a lot of voters in this site just don''t like the "edited look" which really doesn''t make sense since we all have this really cool editing capabilities. Nicely done in my estimation!', '2007-04-05 20:09:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(3523507, 485813, 68947, '<td valign="top">OMG.........I am REALLY laughing at this shot!!!!  This is SO CUTE!!!!  I had a chihuahua growing up and the courage in that little one was unbelievable!  This is just TOO precious a shot!!!!  LOVE IT!!!!!</td>', 'OMG.........I am REALLY laughing at this shot!!!!  This is SO CUTE!!!!  I had a chihuahua growing up and the courage in that little one was unbelievable!  This is just TOO precious a shot!!!!  LOVE IT!!!!!', '2007-04-05 20:10:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3523509, 478680, 67844, '<td valign="top">Nice close-up but the darker edges of the bird look distorted by either sharpening or contrast adjustments, and it draws my eye from the nicer parts.</td>', 'Nice close-up but the darker edges of the bird look distorted by either sharpening or contrast adjustments, and it draws my eye from the nicer parts.', '2007-04-05 20:11:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(3523510, 486881, 68947, '<td valign="top">Nice clear shot, but I''d say that the editing is just a bit overdone.  It kind of makes the model look "unreal".</td>', 'Nice clear shot, but I''d say that the editing is just a bit overdone.  It kind of makes the model look "unreal".', '2007-04-05 20:11:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(3523511, 482912, 68947, '<td valign="top">Wow, I REALLY like this shot!  It kind of reminds me of something from a dream about "heaven".  Nicely done!</td>', 'Wow, I REALLY like this shot!  It kind of reminds me of something from a dream about "heaven".  Nicely done!', '2007-04-05 20:12:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3523513, 490837, 68947, '<td valign="top">Love the composition and colors!!!  Wow, I want to be there now!</td>', 'Love the composition and colors!!!  Wow, I want to be there now!', '2007-04-05 20:12:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(3523518, 487481, 67844, '<td valign="top">This photo would look better if shot from a different angle. And the lens flare is distracting. Using your hand to block the sun from hitting the lens is a very useful trick.</td>', 'This photo would look better if shot from a different angle. And the lens flare is distracting. Using your hand to block the sun from hitting the lens is a very useful trick.', '2007-04-05 20:13:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3523522, 490899, 66384, '<td valign="top">Very strong with the clear primary colors.</td>', 'Very strong with the clear primary colors.', '2007-04-05 20:14:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3523523, 478855, 68947, '<td valign="top">nicely done city scape.  Love the colors!</td>', 'nicely done city scape.  Love the colors!', '2007-04-05 20:14:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(3523528, 484224, 68947, '<td valign="top">I like the idea behind this, but I''m afraid that the voters in this challenge will likely vote it low because it''s "abstract" and very edited.  Most want to see only "pure photos" with very little evidence of editing.</td>', 'I like the idea behind this, but I''m afraid that the voters in this challenge will likely vote it low because it''s "abstract" and very edited.  Most want to see only "pure photos" with very little evidence of editing.', '2007-04-05 20:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
