(3524165, 490827, 5822, '<td valign="top">A generic bridal picture possibly expressing contemplation pre-nuptuals? Beautiful tones, contrast, composition, DOF, and even though we can''t make eye contact, her eyes are still the focal point and lead the viewer down towards her sexuality. An exceptionally well done and professionally produced image.</td>', 'A generic bridal picture possibly expressing contemplation pre-nuptuals? Beautiful tones, contrast, composition, DOF, and even though we can''t make eye contact, her eyes are still the focal point and lead the viewer down towards her sexuality. An exceptionally well done and professionally produced image.', '2007-04-06 01:31:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3524168, 490815, 5822, '<td valign="top">Tonal quality is exceptional but the composition is uninspiring.</td>', 'Tonal quality is exceptional but the composition is uninspiring.', '2007-04-06 01:33:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(3524173, 489181, 5822, '<td valign="top">Marilyn Manson without makeup and costume?</td>', 'Marilyn Manson without makeup and costume?', '2007-04-06 01:36:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(3524180, 490908, 5822, '<td valign="top">Too yellow, needs a color balance.</td>', 'Too yellow, needs a color balance.', '2007-04-06 01:38:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3524191, 489827, 58845, '<td valign="top">Nicely balanced. Very nicely done.  I like the mood in this.</td>', 'Nicely balanced. Very nicely done.  I like the mood in this.', '2007-04-06 01:44:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3524197, 491086, 5822, '<td valign="top">Sorry, I don''t see any haze, just a glaring light. Still, a very good picture as I like the night sky and steeple (though it''s a bit too dark) and overall, it''s got an errieness about it. If you could do something about the unbalanced exposure, it would be a great photo.</td>', 'Sorry, I don''t see any haze, just a glaring light. Still, a very good picture as I like the night sky and steeple (though it''s a bit too dark) and overall, it''s got an errieness about it. If you could do something about the unbalanced exposure, it would be a great photo.', '2007-04-06 01:46:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(3524230, 483238, 5822, '<td valign="top">I''ll bet she''s got smelly feet and hairy legs. lol<br/>It really is a good photo, though, with an interesting composition and dragonaizer effect works for me. I''m ambivalent about her being pushed against the extreme side of the frame. I''d be curious if the bride found this picture complementary.</td>', 'I''ll bet she''s got smelly feet and hairy legs. lolIt really is a good photo, though, with an interesting composition and dragonaizer effect works for me. I''m ambivalent about her being pushed against the extreme side of the frame. I''d be curious if the bride found this picture complementary.', '2007-04-06 02:00:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(3524233, 490998, 58845, '<td valign="top">This looks like a painting.  The sun is so bright I feel like I shouldn''t look at it.  My eyes instantly drop to the patch of grass which has retained a good exposure.</td>', 'This looks like a painting.  The sun is so bright I feel like I shouldn''t look at it.  My eyes instantly drop to the patch of grass which has retained a good exposure.', '2007-04-06 02:01:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(3524238, 490875, 58845, '<td valign="top">There is something yummy about this picture.  I like what you''ve done to it.  Nice perspective.    I imagine this would be a nice black and white as well.</td>', 'There is something yummy about this picture.  I like what you''ve done to it.  Nice perspective.    I imagine this would be a nice black and white as well.', '2007-04-06 02:05:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(3524242, 490501, 58845, '<td valign="top">A fantastic photo!  This photo ''reaches out''.  Simple, straight forward with action.  There is no doubt about the main suject.</td>', 'A fantastic photo!  This photo ''reaches out''.  Simple, straight forward with action.  There is no doubt about the main suject.', '2007-04-06 02:08:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3524245, 489585, 58845, '<td valign="top">Perfect title.  Nice catch.</td>', 'Perfect title.  Nice catch.', '2007-04-06 02:09:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(3524252, 489327, 5822, '<td valign="top">This looks too contrived to me. The boy appears clean, well noursished and well taken care of, and his expression affected. I hope I''m right.</td>', 'This looks too contrived to me. The boy appears clean, well noursished and well taken care of, and his expression affected. I hope I''m right.', '2007-04-06 02:14:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3524254, 490962, 58845, '<td valign="top">Now that''s colorful, and well framing.</td>', 'Now that''s colorful, and well framing.', '2007-04-06 02:16:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3524258, 490681, 5822, '<td valign="top">I''d like to use one of the words in your title to describe my feelings about the title.</td>', 'I''d like to use one of the words in your title to describe my feelings about the title.', '2007-04-06 02:19:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3524260, 484615, 58845, '<td valign="top">I like your perspective on this mail box.  The cracks at the bottom is a nice detail.</td>', 'I like your perspective on this mail box.  The cracks at the bottom is a nice detail.', '2007-04-06 02:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3524261, 490232, 5822, '<td valign="top">Too bad the leaf partially obstructs view of the beautiful butterfly.</td>', 'Too bad the leaf partially obstructs view of the beautiful butterfly.', '2007-04-06 02:21:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(3524263, 487902, 58845, '<td valign="top">I like the colors in this photo.  I wish it were a bit more in focus, but it''s an interesting photo.</td>', 'I like the colors in this photo.  I wish it were a bit more in focus, but it''s an interesting photo.', '2007-04-06 02:23:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(3524264, 490078, 5822, '<td valign="top">I like the toning of the flower, but not it''s position in the frame or all that negative space. Would have preferred a larger subject with more detail to look at.</td>', 'I like the toning of the flower, but not it''s position in the frame or all that negative space. Would have preferred a larger subject with more detail to look at.', '2007-04-06 02:23:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3524267, 490778, 5822, '<td valign="top">Background needs some saturation, imo, and I wish the bird had more detail evident in it''s feathers. However, still a good photo nonetheless and would be good used in a field guide or nature magazine for identification.</td>', 'Background needs some saturation, imo, and I wish the bird had more detail evident in it''s feathers. However, still a good photo nonetheless and would be good used in a field guide or nature magazine for identification.', '2007-04-06 02:32:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3524273, 491097, 5822, '<td valign="top">I like the vintage toning but wish the lettering weren''t in focus as it detracts from the otherwise dreamy affect.</td>', 'I like the vintage toning but wish the lettering weren''t in focus as it detracts from the otherwise dreamy affect.', '2007-04-06 02:40:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3524276, 487188, 58845, '<td valign="top">How cute!  Great shot.  Redwinged Blackbirds have the neatest song too.  He looks like he dressed up for this photo.</td>', 'How cute!  Great shot.  Redwinged Blackbirds have the neatest song too.  He looks like he dressed up for this photo.', '2007-04-06 02:41:48.000000', NULL, 1),
