(3524281, 487678, 71499, '<td valign="top">Wow. <br/>I hardly know what to say. <br/>AMAZING...<br/>the colors, mood, sharpness, texture....<br/>resembles a painting in so many ways. <br/>10 from me, I LOVE IT!</td>', 'Wow. I hardly know what to say. AMAZING...the colors, mood, sharpness, texture....resembles a painting in so many ways. 10 from me, I LOVE IT!', '2007-04-06 02:46:31.000000', NULL, 1),
