(3524288, 488146, 5822, '<td valign="top">Too much dragon and along with the wide angle, distorts to become a caricature. Does your model think this is flattering? Maybe I''m wrong.</td>', 'Too much dragon and along with the wide angle, distorts to become a caricature. Does your model think this is flattering? Maybe I''m wrong.', '2007-04-06 02:55:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(3524291, 484486, 58845, '<td valign="top">Car photos that stand out are hard to capture.  This one really stands out.  Fantastic!</td>', 'Car photos that stand out are hard to capture.  This one really stands out.  Fantastic!', '2007-04-06 02:59:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(3524295, 491043, 5822, '<td valign="top">Distance to subject, angle of view, and lighting are effective in conveying a sense of thinking about the past. Out of focus areas also contribute, but need some work in their implementation, imo, as they look too spotty. What the heck is that electrical cord doing dang smack in the middle of your picture???!!! Ruins the affect for me.</td>', 'Distance to subject, angle of view, and lighting are effective in conveying a sense of thinking about the past. Out of focus areas also contribute, but need some work in their implementation, imo, as they look too spotty. What the heck is that electrical cord doing dang smack in the middle of your picture???!!! Ruins the affect for me.', '2007-04-06 03:05:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3524313, 491133, 58845, '<td valign="top">I like the softness in this photo.  The mood is pleasant.  I really wish the dpchallenge header bar didn''t ''top'' the photos.  It''s rather distracting. For some reason, it is particularly distracting on this photo. When the bar is hidden from view, the balance in this picture stands out.</td>', 'I like the softness in this photo.  The mood is pleasant.  I really wish the dpchallenge header bar didn''t ''top'' the photos.  It''s rather distracting. For some reason, it is particularly distracting on this photo. When the bar is hidden from view, the balance in this picture stands out.', '2007-04-06 03:15:56.000000', NULL, 1),
