(3525023, 485968, 68947, '<td valign="top">Wow, what a phenominal photo!!!  I''m sure that you''re getting some morons giving you critical comments on nit-picking technical aspects, but I can tell you that I really LOVE this refreshingly different and very "deep" shot! Unfortunately, it seems the "artsy" shots don''t always do well in this site it seems.  Nude models do well though! *grin, sigh*  I really like this shot!  Time to get away from flowers, babies and traditional style, technically "perfect" photography in here.  10 from me!</td>', 'Wow, what a phenominal photo!!!  I''m sure that you''re getting some morons giving you critical comments on nit-picking technical aspects, but I can tell you that I really LOVE this refreshingly different and very "deep" shot! Unfortunately, it seems the "artsy" shots don''t always do well in this site it seems.  Nude models do well though! *grin, sigh*  I really like this shot!  Time to get away from flowers, babies and traditional style, technically "perfect" photography in here.  10 from me!', '2007-04-06 12:58:03.000000', NULL, 1),
