(3525921, 485968, 50695, '<td valign="top">This is out of focus, and I can see reflections in the glass. Very distracting. Next time, take your model out from behind the glass and have him look directly into the camera. And where are the colors?</td>', 'This is out of focus, and I can see reflections in the glass. Very distracting. Next time, take your model out from behind the glass and have him look directly into the camera. And where are the colors?', '2007-04-06 18:34:43.000000', NULL, 1),
