(3526002, 490417, 62787, '<td valign="top">Powerful image. Manages to have death, child labour and sadness all in one image. However, I think a different POV would have done the image more justice - maybe taken from lower down, with the camera pointing more to the right and getting rid of some of the empty space (at the moment it just looks unbalanced).</td>', 'Powerful image. Manages to have death, child labour and sadness all in one image. However, I think a different POV would have done the image more justice - maybe taken from lower down, with the camera pointing more to the right and getting rid of some of the empty space (at the moment it just looks unbalanced).', '2007-04-06 19:07:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(3526005, 490797, 62787, '<td valign="top">Beautiful portrait. Very good work. I wish I knew how to do that :)</td>', 'Beautiful portrait. Very good work. I wish I knew how to do that :)', '2007-04-06 19:08:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3526008, 487511, 62787, '<td valign="top">Good street shot.</td>', 'Good street shot.', '2007-04-06 19:08:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3526010, 490881, 62787, '<td valign="top">Aww, sweet! And I like the picture, very good composition. Though the tone of the feathers is a bit too red for me (I think I would have reduced the saturation of that part, while leaving the head bright red)</td>', 'Aww, sweet! And I like the picture, very good composition. Though the tone of the feathers is a bit too red for me (I think I would have reduced the saturation of that part, while leaving the head bright red)', '2007-04-06 19:09:58.000000', NULL, 1),
