(3527621, 487339, 70270, '<td valign="top">Fresh take of a well-photographed view; framing the Transamerica Pyramid in the GG Bridge tower is something I have not seen before.  I like the blue cast to the skyline as well.  It would be nice to see a little more light on the bridge to bring out its color, or maybe go slightly darker to make the silhouette more dramatic.</td>', 'Fresh take of a well-photographed view; framing the Transamerica Pyramid in the GG Bridge tower is something I have not seen before.  I like the blue cast to the skyline as well.  It would be nice to see a little more light on the bridge to bring out its color, or maybe go slightly darker to make the silhouette more dramatic.', '2007-04-07 13:42:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3527624, 486226, 70270, '<td valign="top">Nice sharpness througout and the colors in both the tulips and the sky are well done.  Borders on looking artificial, but works, in a kind of Wizard of Oz sort of way.  8</td>', 'Nice sharpness througout and the colors in both the tulips and the sky are well done.  Borders on looking artificial, but works, in a kind of Wizard of Oz sort of way.  8', '2007-04-07 13:44:09.000000', NULL, 1),
