(3527885, 487481, 50695, '<td valign="top">fascinating. I almost went by this too quickly, except that a quick look returns nothing. the photo is too complex for a quick look. 8 bump to 9. go, subtlety!</td>', 'fascinating. I almost went by this too quickly, except that a quick look returns nothing. the photo is too complex for a quick look. 8 bump to 9. go, subtlety!', '2007-04-07 15:51:39.000000', NULL, 1),
