(3527895, 490114, 50695, '<td valign="top">the overall composition favors the right side, but the face is revealing its left side (from my pov), creating a dynamic balance from counteracting imbalances. Then there is the dark oval of hair interrupted by the squares of color. A really, really good composition. 9</td>', 'the overall composition favors the right side, but the face is revealing its left side (from my pov), creating a dynamic balance from counteracting imbalances. Then there is the dark oval of hair interrupted by the squares of color. A really, really good composition. 9', '2007-04-07 15:56:57.000000', NULL, 1),
