(3527899, 491120, 61651, '<td valign="top">I just really like the focus on this, and the way it is lit.  Very nicely done.</td>', 'I just really like the focus on this, and the way it is lit.  Very nicely done.', '2007-04-07 15:57:29.000000', NULL, 1),
