(3527908, 490527, 50695, '<td valign="top">this is funny. I feel I am laughing with her, not at her. It has the kind of strange intimacy I see in Diane Arbus pictures. 9</td>', 'this is funny. I feel I am laughing with her, not at her. It has the kind of strange intimacy I see in Diane Arbus pictures. 9', '2007-04-07 16:02:03.000000', NULL, 1),
