(3528140, 490507, 61961, '<td valign="top">I give this a 10 and hope it does very well.  So many times it seems b&amp;w is used to make a poor photo artistic, and worse, the conversion to b&amp;w is often flat.  This b&amp;w seems fully integrated and necessary.  The lone figure, the road sign, the flag, power lines, etc., and all that blowing white -- wow!</td>', 'I give this a 10 and hope it does very well.  So many times it seems b&w is used to make a poor photo artistic, and worse, the conversion to b&w is often flat.  This b&w seems fully integrated and necessary.  The lone figure, the road sign, the flag, power lines, etc., and all that blowing white -- wow!', '2007-04-07 17:59:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3528141, 490696, 61961, '<td valign="top">One of my "10s".  I love the lighting, and how the train and tracks lead the eye back to the lone tower in the distance, highlighted by a lighter sky.  The hole in the clouds over the woman''s head is like a spotlight pointing to her.  A wonderful photo.</td>', 'One of my "10s".  I love the lighting, and how the train and tracks lead the eye back to the lone tower in the distance, highlighted by a lighter sky.  The hole in the clouds over the woman''s head is like a spotlight pointing to her.  A wonderful photo.', '2007-04-07 17:59:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(3528142, 487590, 61961, '<td valign="top">Funny how the small plant anchors this photo.  The colors are sensational here.  A really strong entry and a 10 from me.</td>', 'Funny how the small plant anchors this photo.  The colors are sensational here.  A really strong entry and a 10 from me.', '2007-04-07 17:59:49.000000', NULL, 1),
