(3528999, 484193, 42495, '<td valign="top">I find this compelling.  The picture suggests the difficult path, with the low branches ready to snag and slow you down.  Sometimes we must choose the difficult path, and in this case it makes a great photo.  I like the high contrast also.  Well done.<br/> <br/>Edit: Just added as a fave.</td>', 'I find this compelling.  The picture suggests the difficult path, with the low branches ready to snag and slow you down.  Sometimes we must choose the difficult path, and in this case it makes a great photo.  I like the high contrast also.  Well done. Edit: Just added as a fave.', '2007-04-08 00:57:47.000000', NULL, 1),
