(3529184, 491010, 24454, '<td valign="top">This is awesome!  This proves 2 things:  1, you just can not TAKE a bad picture.  You probably look like that the minute you wake up in the morning too. Amazing :)   and 2, a talented photographer can turn the simplest scene into extraordinary art!  I''m so impressed!  Congratulations on such a great finish!<br/> <br/></td>', 'This is awesome!  This proves 2 things:  1, you just can not TAKE a bad picture.  You probably look like that the minute you wake up in the morning too. Amazing :)   and 2, a talented photographer can turn the simplest scene into extraordinary art!  I''m so impressed!  Congratulations on such a great finish! ', '2007-04-08 02:03:42.000000', NULL, 0),
(3529188, 487242, 18450, '<td valign="top">You know, whenever you see this image in the future you''ll remember Craven, the beauty of the morning, smell the sea.........that''s wonderful! Lovely story and image.</td>', 'You know, whenever you see this image in the future you''ll remember Craven, the beauty of the morning, smell the sea.........that''s wonderful! Lovely story and image.', '2007-04-08 02:05:16.000000', NULL, 0),
(3529189, 490835, 24454, '<td valign="top">As soon as I saw this, I wondered if it was yours.   I''m starting to recognize that stunning Newfoundland beauty after our challenge.  This photo took my breath away just like all your Newfoundland photos do!  I think this is quite underrated!<br/> <br/></td>', 'As soon as I saw this, I wondered if it was yours.   I''m starting to recognize that stunning Newfoundland beauty after our challenge.  This photo took my breath away just like all your Newfoundland photos do!  I think this is quite underrated! ', '2007-04-08 02:05:19.000000', NULL, 0),
(3529193, 481971, 33352, '<td valign="top">I agree with Sandy,  but maybe flowers have had thier day in free study, I know one came in third, with a lot of tone mapping.</td>', 'I agree with Sandy,  but maybe flowers have had thier day in free study, I know one came in third, with a lot of tone mapping.', '2007-04-08 02:06:00.000000', NULL, 0),
