(3529203, 478848, 24454, '<td valign="top">I am shocked that this photo only scored 6.27!  It is amazing!    Not that 6.27 is a bad score -- its just that I think this photo is extraordinary with its amazing sharpness, those beautiful colors, and that mirror reflection!   Wow!<br/> <br/></td>', 'I am shocked that this photo only scored 6.27!  It is amazing!    Not that 6.27 is a bad score -- its just that I think this photo is extraordinary with its amazing sharpness, those beautiful colors, and that mirror reflection!   Wow! ', '2007-04-08 02:08:57.000000', NULL, 0),
