(3530243, 484079, 74979, '<td valign="top">i thought this was going to be a top 10!! I was one of your 8''s  ~I think it''s a great shot &amp; hammers home the irony of poverty &amp; yet how children can still be children, despite the odds against them.  Great shot!! I wonder if they learn in the processing of begging how "cute" can get them some extra coins?<br/> <br/>(edited b/c I can''t type!)<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2007-04-17 22:04:01.</i></td>', 'i thought this was going to be a top 10!! I was one of your 8''s  ~I think it''s a great shot & hammers home the irony of poverty & yet how children can still be children, despite the odds against them.  Great shot!! I wonder if they learn in the processing of begging how "cute" can get them some extra coins? (edited b/c I can''t type!)', '2007-04-08 16:20:34.000000', '2007-04-17 23:04:01.000000', 0),
