(3530411, 490961, 66384, '<td valign="top">Very nice capture of the birds. I think the idea of leaving the legs in the shot was brilliant. I''m sure I would have cropped them out, and that''s why your photo scored 6.5 while mine scored 5.5. Congratulation on a good shot, and a good score and placement.</td>', 'Very nice capture of the birds. I think the idea of leaving the legs in the shot was brilliant. I''m sure I would have cropped them out, and that''s why your photo scored 6.5 while mine scored 5.5. Congratulation on a good shot, and a good score and placement.', '2007-04-08 17:46:54.000000', NULL, 0),
