(3530452, 491010, 66384, '<td valign="top">You really work magic. How can someone ironing be so captivating?! Well The Potato Peeler is also captivating. It seems the subject hardly matters, it''s all in the presentation and the light. Congratulation on another outstanding image.<br/> <br/>P.S. I like this much better than the other, uncropped, version in your portfolio.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2007-04-08 17:20:38.</i></td>', 'You really work magic. How can someone ironing be so captivating?! Well The Potato Peeler is also captivating. It seems the subject hardly matters, it''s all in the presentation and the light. Congratulation on another outstanding image. P.S. I like this much better than the other, uncropped, version in your portfolio.', '2007-04-08 18:09:11.000000', '2007-04-08 18:20:38.000000', 0),
(3530479, 484716, 18080, '<td valign="top">I can''t understand why this scored so low?<br/>I gave you one of your 8s.<br/>Subject is placed in an interesting place. Background is the right amount OOF! Pretty colours! Great expression on yur models face! But still only 5.<br/>I''ll never understand the voters of DPC.<br/>Keep up the good work.<br/>There are ribbons waiting for you.<br/> <br/>Kev</td>', 'I can''t understand why this scored so low?I gave you one of your 8s.Subject is placed in an interesting place. Background is the right amount OOF! Pretty colours! Great expression on yur models face! But still only 5.I''ll never understand the voters of DPC.Keep up the good work.There are ribbons waiting for you. Kev', '2007-04-08 18:30:10.000000', NULL, 0),
(3530501, 487765, 66384, '<td valign="top">I think the composition hurt the score. The subject is dead center with empty space to the right and a half a cow on the left. And while the cow is standing straight up, the slope of the land makes it look as though the photo needs straightening. I like the textures and the colors in the pasture, even though they look unnaturally orange on my monitor. In spite of all these negative things I said, I like the shot and gave it a 6.</td>', 'I think the composition hurt the score. The subject is dead center with empty space to the right and a half a cow on the left. And while the cow is standing straight up, the slope of the land makes it look as though the photo needs straightening. I like the textures and the colors in the pasture, even though they look unnaturally orange on my monitor. In spite of all these negative things I said, I like the shot and gave it a 6.', '2007-04-08 18:46:09.000000', NULL, 0),
