(3530940, 478328, 35602, '<td valign="top">I just looked at this image, and was surprised at its low score.  It is really pretty.  I have a feeling it was the small size that brought the score down.  If you need help to figure out how to make your images bigger  let me know.  There is a lot you can do in the save to increase the size.</td>', 'I just looked at this image, and was surprised at its low score.  It is really pretty.  I have a feeling it was the small size that brought the score down.  If you need help to figure out how to make your images bigger  let me know.  There is a lot you can do in the save to increase the size.', '2007-04-08 22:36:16.000000', NULL, 0),
(3530942, 489698, 53316, '<td valign="top">I thought this was a decent shot but I found it a little busy - I think either a looser crop would have helped, or having the background a different color so that there would be less of similar color for the eye to focus on, if that makes sense.</td>', 'I thought this was a decent shot but I found it a little busy - I think either a looser crop would have helped, or having the background a different color so that there would be less of similar color for the eye to focus on, if that makes sense.', '2007-04-08 22:36:52.000000', NULL, 0),
(3530948, 490094, 35602, '<td valign="top">Like your processing on the upper part of the image.  As to the water, I think the overexposure of the lower part of the fall might have hurt you.  I bit of burning in would have made it more true to life.</td>', 'Like your processing on the upper part of the image.  As to the water, I think the overexposure of the lower part of the fall might have hurt you.  I bit of burning in would have made it more true to life.', '2007-04-08 22:38:36.000000', NULL, 0),
