(3531174, 487472, 24454, '<td valign="top">Ohmy!!  These photos are breathtaking!  I don''t think I''ve seen anything as beautiful either!  Congratulations on this no-brainer for a great score and high placement!<br/> <br/>I feel so sad especially for the birds being in cages and having their wings clipped too.   In our zoo, alot of the birds were wounded and rescued and they can''t fly anyway so it feels a little better.   I guess at least they are safe and well cared for and have the cameraderie of companionship forever.<br/> <br/>You sure got some SPECTACULAR photographs of them!!<br/> <br/></td>', 'Ohmy!!  These photos are breathtaking!  I don''t think I''ve seen anything as beautiful either!  Congratulations on this no-brainer for a great score and high placement! I feel so sad especially for the birds being in cages and having their wings clipped too.   In our zoo, alot of the birds were wounded and rescued and they can''t fly anyway so it feels a little better.   I guess at least they are safe and well cared for and have the cameraderie of companionship forever. You sure got some SPECTACULAR photographs of them!! ', '2007-04-09 00:20:17.000000', NULL, 0),
