(3532434, 490479, 24454, '<td valign="top">I am so disappointed that this photo didn''t get the top recognition it deserves!  I think you got robbed!   I still look at it in awe as I realize what you accomplished in getting such detail in a moving EAGLE!!!   This is an outstanding photo and one of my highest scoring photos in the whole challenge!<br/> <br/></td>', 'I am so disappointed that this photo didn''t get the top recognition it deserves!  I think you got robbed!   I still look at it in awe as I realize what you accomplished in getting such detail in a moving EAGLE!!!   This is an outstanding photo and one of my highest scoring photos in the whole challenge! ', '2007-04-09 11:39:58.000000', NULL, 0),
