(3532876, 484615, 24454, '<td valign="top">Tee hee. . .you are almost there at your coveted 6 mark :)   For what it''s worth, I think this is definitely worth at least a 6.  And look at the score your commenters (the REAL DPC''ers :) gave you.   The processing has that edgy grungy look that is so popular on DPC.  I love it!   I think this is really artistic and rich, and I have a feeling that if it were in any other challenge besides the "oh-so-brutal" free study, it would have easily been in the 6''s!<br/> <br/></td>', 'Tee hee. . .you are almost there at your coveted 6 mark :)   For what it''s worth, I think this is definitely worth at least a 6.  And look at the score your commenters (the REAL DPC''ers :) gave you.   The processing has that edgy grungy look that is so popular on DPC.  I love it!   I think this is really artistic and rich, and I have a feeling that if it were in any other challenge besides the "oh-so-brutal" free study, it would have easily been in the 6''s! ', '2007-04-09 14:20:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(3532883, 489725, 42100, '<td valign="top">Very emotive and very underrated...a wonderful photograph!</td>', 'Very emotive and very underrated...a wonderful photograph!', '2007-04-09 14:22:11.000000', NULL, 0),
(3532931, 489673, 60701, '<td valign="top">This shot immediately reminds me of the classic photo advertising Gross Morne National Park in Canada.  Here''s a web version of the photo (<a href="//canada.travelall.com/images/nfdld/Gros_morne_fiord.jpg" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Park Ad</a>).  I can''t find a better quality version on the web but when seen full size the only thing different is the background.<br/> <br/>Nice shot.</td>', 'This shot immediately reminds me of the classic photo advertising Gross Morne National Park in Canada.  Here''s a web version of the photo (Park Ad).  I can''t find a better quality version on the web but when seen full size the only thing different is the background. Nice shot.', '2007-04-09 14:36:18.000000', NULL, 0),
(3532947, 490348, 24454, '<td valign="top">Shez, this is so beautiful!  I would have expected this to finish with a much higher score than 5.9.  It''s so hard to find just the right balance of processing.   It seems to me that DPC''ers rather like the very processed looks in photos -- but I guess there''s a very fine line <br/>for when they blast you with "too much", huh?<br/> <br/>I think you should be very proud of this.  It''s lovely!<br/> <br/></td>', 'Shez, this is so beautiful!  I would have expected this to finish with a much higher score than 5.9.  It''s so hard to find just the right balance of processing.   It seems to me that DPC''ers rather like the very processed looks in photos -- but I guess there''s a very fine line for when they blast you with "too much", huh? I think you should be very proud of this.  It''s lovely! ', '2007-04-09 14:44:17.000000', NULL, 0),
(3532994, 487188, 30982, '<td valign="top">Great expression from your model, and those guys can be tough to work with!  I got a kick out of this one when voting - delighted to see it''s yours.</td>', 'Great expression from your model, and those guys can be tough to work with!  I got a kick out of this one when voting - delighted to see it''s yours.', '2007-04-09 15:05:40.000000', NULL, 0),
(3533001, 487765, 30982, '<td valign="top">I like cow pictures.  I like this cow looking at you while you take the picture.  I kinda agree a bit with Julianne about the composition - maybe if you''d had a bit more space to the right, and a bit less of the other cow it would balance better.  The colors are a bit unnatural, but that works for this shot, I think.</td>', 'I like cow pictures.  I like this cow looking at you while you take the picture.  I kinda agree a bit with Julianne about the composition - maybe if you''d had a bit more space to the right, and a bit less of the other cow it would balance better.  The colors are a bit unnatural, but that works for this shot, I think.', '2007-04-09 15:07:39.000000', NULL, 0),
(3533002, 480874, 30982, '<td valign="top">I was one of your 8s as well.  I really liked this.  I think it would be a lovely framed print on your wall, since these are your people.</td>', 'I was one of your 8s as well.  I really liked this.  I think it would be a lovely framed print on your wall, since these are your people.', '2007-04-09 15:09:15.000000', NULL, 0),
(3533019, 490905, 48607, '<td valign="top">CONGRATS on your 5th palce! this shot is Amazing <br/>i''m almost positive your next shot will ribbon :)</td>', 'CONGRATS on your 5th palce! this shot is Amazing i''m almost positive your next shot will ribbon :)', '2007-04-09 15:15:37.000000', NULL, 0),
(3533020, 484602, 30982, '<td valign="top">Cute little dude!  And Sandy loves it, so you know it''s gotta be good!</td>', 'Cute little dude!  And Sandy loves it, so you know it''s gotta be good!', '2007-04-09 15:15:38.000000', NULL, 0),
(3533026, 490878, 30982, '<td valign="top">This is a lovely, quiet shot that doesn''t get the attention it deserves in a free study.  Looks to have been a gorgeous day!</td>', 'This is a lovely, quiet shot that doesn''t get the attention it deserves in a free study.  Looks to have been a gorgeous day!', '2007-04-09 15:17:18.000000', NULL, 0),
(3533031, 490849, 30982, '<td valign="top">Quiet and lovely.  I like that the sprog titled it, too.</td>', 'Quiet and lovely.  I like that the sprog titled it, too.', '2007-04-09 15:18:46.000000', NULL, 0),
(3533044, 490472, 30982, '<td valign="top">I thought this very aptly titled, as it''s the smile that makes the picture.</td>', 'I thought this very aptly titled, as it''s the smile that makes the picture.', '2007-04-09 15:21:26.000000', NULL, 0),
(3533053, 489721, 64795, '<td valign="top">I love the clutter.  I love how you get a feeling of disorganization and chaos from this photo.  It really makes it interesting</td>', 'I love the clutter.  I love how you get a feeling of disorganization and chaos from this photo.  It really makes it interesting', '2007-04-09 15:24:40.000000', NULL, 0),
(3533056, 490779, 30982, '<td valign="top">A very cute pose by both of them, though the critter is looking just a tad nervous.  Catherine already remarked that midday sun can be kinda harsh, but I figure if you want to get a shot and it''s midday and the sun is out - go with it!  Not everything needs to be the umpteenth degree of art - sometimes a picture is just a picture and that''s good.</td>', 'A very cute pose by both of them, though the critter is looking just a tad nervous.  Catherine already remarked that midday sun can be kinda harsh, but I figure if you want to get a shot and it''s midday and the sun is out - go with it!  Not everything needs to be the umpteenth degree of art - sometimes a picture is just a picture and that''s good.', '2007-04-09 15:25:03.000000', NULL, 0),
(3533065, 484800, 30982, '<td valign="top">I kinda like the triangular composition, created by the triangle of the fence to begin with, then the horse then the building.  In my uneducated opinion, cropping a bit off the top helps strengthen the composition.</td>', 'I kinda like the triangular composition, created by the triangle of the fence to begin with, then the horse then the building.  In my uneducated opinion, cropping a bit off the top helps strengthen the composition.', '2007-04-09 15:27:27.000000', NULL, 0),
(3533075, 489698, 30982, '<td valign="top">I liked this one, Kelli.  Very good detail, especially on their skin, and good strong diagonal composition.  Maybe a bit more on the left side - have his whole foot in the shot?  I don''t know, though.  I think it works pretty well the way it is.</td>', 'I liked this one, Kelli.  Very good detail, especially on their skin, and good strong diagonal composition.  Maybe a bit more on the left side - have his whole foot in the shot?  I don''t know, though.  I think it works pretty well the way it is.', '2007-04-09 15:30:16.000000', NULL, 0),
(3533081, 490587, 30982, '<td valign="top">Apparently voters aren''t Christmas light friendly this time of year.  Heck, for all we know, they could be Easter lights.  I gave it a 6.  For some reason it struck me as a little lonely.</td>', 'Apparently voters aren''t Christmas light friendly this time of year.  Heck, for all we know, they could be Easter lights.  I gave it a 6.  For some reason it struck me as a little lonely.', '2007-04-09 15:31:45.000000', NULL, 0),
(3533099, 488515, 30982, '<td valign="top">I liked the title - my grandparents had a farm in Utah and my grandpa was on the local water board.  Water rights are a big thing in the west.  Nice composition, lovely deep blues in the water.</td>', 'I liked the title - my grandparents had a farm in Utah and my grandpa was on the local water board.  Water rights are a big thing in the west.  Nice composition, lovely deep blues in the water.', '2007-04-09 15:33:58.000000', NULL, 0),
(3533109, 487572, 30982, '<td valign="top">Very crisp and clean - you get marvelous clarity and tonal range in your black and white conversions.  You should do a short tutorial and let the rest of us in on your secrets!</td>', 'Very crisp and clean - you get marvelous clarity and tonal range in your black and white conversions.  You should do a short tutorial and let the rest of us in on your secrets!', '2007-04-09 15:35:02.000000', NULL, 0),
(3533112, 491151, 30982, '<td valign="top">Nice minimalism.  Has a sense of spaciousness and freedom to it.</td>', 'Nice minimalism.  Has a sense of spaciousness and freedom to it.', '2007-04-09 15:35:51.000000', NULL, 0);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(3533122, 488043, 30982, '<td valign="top">Good capture of the artwork.  What would be really cool is if you could get the artist to pose there!  We have a similar situation here, where the graffiti changes from time to time.  I just noticed that your vignetting covers your border as well - that''s an interesting trick!</td>', 'Good capture of the artwork.  What would be really cool is if you could get the artist to pose there!  We have a similar situation here, where the graffiti changes from time to time.  I just noticed that your vignetting covers your border as well - that''s an interesting trick!', '2007-04-09 15:38:10.000000', NULL, 0),
(3533125, 490479, 30982, '<td valign="top">The detail in his talons and tail feathers is amazing.  GREAT capture.  Birds in flight are tough, in my opinion - looks like you''ve got the hang of it!</td>', 'The detail in his talons and tail feathers is amazing.  GREAT capture.  Birds in flight are tough, in my opinion - looks like you''ve got the hang of it!', '2007-04-09 15:39:29.000000', NULL, 0),
(3533129, 491010, 30982, '<td valign="top">Congrats on the new personal best!</td>', 'Congrats on the new personal best!', '2007-04-09 15:40:45.000000', NULL, 0),
(3533135, 483689, 30982, '<td valign="top">I thought this was quite excellent.  Still do!  :-)</td>', 'I thought this was quite excellent.  Still do!  :-)', '2007-04-09 15:42:16.000000', NULL, 0),
(3533152, 486994, 30982, '<td valign="top">I like your processing mostly because it looks very natural to me.  Not sure about the composition, but I do like the idea behind it.  I can''t decide if less car or more car would work better.</td>', 'I like your processing mostly because it looks very natural to me.  Not sure about the composition, but I do like the idea behind it.  I can''t decide if less car or more car would work better.', '2007-04-09 15:46:56.000000', NULL, 0),
(3533153, 484079, 42100, '<td valign="top">Very charming photograph Enzo...and so well executed!</td>', 'Very charming photograph Enzo...and so well executed!', '2007-04-09 15:47:45.000000', NULL, 0),
(3533156, 490649, 30982, '<td valign="top">How cool is it that you have deer in your backyard?  I like the pose you caught.  The background colors have a sorta strange cast to them that I can''t quite figure - sorta purple-green.  But your subject is adorable and good job working with the off-center bit!</td>', 'How cool is it that you have deer in your backyard?  I like the pose you caught.  The background colors have a sorta strange cast to them that I can''t quite figure - sorta purple-green.  But your subject is adorable and good job working with the off-center bit!', '2007-04-09 15:49:04.000000', NULL, 0),
(3533157, 486881, 42100, '<td valign="top">Stunning photograph and such a fascinating person.  Great job!</td>', 'Stunning photograph and such a fascinating person.  Great job!', '2007-04-09 15:49:22.000000', NULL, 0),
(3533163, 487427, 30982, '<td valign="top">Interesting title to this one - and I like the shot.  Has sort of a dismal, bleak feel to it, which I figure based on your title, is sort of what you were after.</td>', 'Interesting title to this one - and I like the shot.  Has sort of a dismal, bleak feel to it, which I figure based on your title, is sort of what you were after.', '2007-04-09 15:50:37.000000', NULL, 0),
(3533164, 490097, 42100, '<td valign="top">Another amazing photo Gunnar!  So charming and interesting...amazing technical execution as well.</td>', 'Another amazing photo Gunnar!  So charming and interesting...amazing technical execution as well.', '2007-04-09 15:50:45.000000', NULL, 0),
(3533169, 490206, 42100, '<td valign="top">This is very beautiful!  You scored well, but I think this needs to go into the highly underrated category.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2007-04-09 14:55:14.</i></td>', 'This is very beautiful!  You scored well, but I think this needs to go into the highly underrated category.', '2007-04-09 15:52:05.000000', '2007-04-09 15:55:14.000000', 0),
(3533244, 483689, 52992, '<td valign="top">Thanks for the kind comments.<br/> <br/>This is one of my favorites - I''ve already got it printed and put into a frame in my living room.</td>', 'Thanks for the kind comments. This is one of my favorites - I''ve already got it printed and put into a frame in my living room.', '2007-04-09 16:15:31.000000', NULL, 0),
(3533310, 480284, 68546, '<td valign="top">Fantastic shot, the B&amp;W and tone mapping make this a fresh and very moody take on the facinating millenium bridge and St Pauls. Great to see a fellow Essex resident with a blue ribbon as well. Great work</td>', 'Fantastic shot, the B&W and tone mapping make this a fresh and very moody take on the facinating millenium bridge and St Pauls. Great to see a fellow Essex resident with a blue ribbon as well. Great work', '2007-04-09 16:31:48.000000', NULL, 0),
(3533331, 488131, 50674, '<td valign="top">Sannkölluð sólskinsmynd, virkilega falleg.<br/>Hér er vorið á hraðferð, óvenju snemma á ferðinni í ár.</td>', 'Sannkölluð sólskinsmynd, virkilega falleg.Hér er vorið á hraðferð, óvenju snemma á ferðinni í ár.', '2007-04-09 16:37:41.000000', NULL, 0),
