(3533472, 490649, 66597, '<td valign="top">Great capture and composition. Think you got hurt a bit by the soft focus and very bright areas in the background (they pull the eyes away from the deer''s face). A bit of burning in the back would have boosted this about 5 tenths of a point IMO.</td>', 'Great capture and composition. Think you got hurt a bit by the soft focus and very bright areas in the background (they pull the eyes away from the deer''s face). A bit of burning in the back would have boosted this about 5 tenths of a point IMO.', '2007-04-09 17:21:43.000000', NULL, 0),
(3533489, 491010, 66193, '<td valign="top">Svetlana, I like the processing that you''ve done on this wonderful capture.  Congrats on the new PB.  Steve</td>', 'Svetlana, I like the processing that you''ve done on this wonderful capture.  Congrats on the new PB.  Steve', '2007-04-09 17:26:30.000000', NULL, 0),
(3533533, 480284, 74056, '<td valign="top">Congratulations on a well deserved win! Stunning photograph.</td>', 'Congratulations on a well deserved win! Stunning photograph.', '2007-04-09 17:48:51.000000', NULL, 0),
(3533540, 490849, 60862, '<td valign="top">This is terrific!  I love your use of shadow and light to convey emotion.  This shot connects with my general dislike of basements when I was a kid and the stairs to the basement were so dark and forbidding.  If I had to go down there at night, I''d grab whatever I needed and then run back up the stairs.</td>', 'This is terrific!  I love your use of shadow and light to convey emotion.  This shot connects with my general dislike of basements when I was a kid and the stairs to the basement were so dark and forbidding.  If I had to go down there at night, I''d grab whatever I needed and then run back up the stairs.', '2007-04-09 17:51:14.000000', NULL, 0),
(3533583, 490538, 73661, '<td valign="top">I skipped on commenting during the voting stage since I cannot vote ''nyway. ^_^<br/>I love your unique and artistic perspective on things. And if this was not staged shot, GREAT and AMAZING timing, too.<br/>This is underrated IMHO. <br/></td>', 'I skipped on commenting during the voting stage since I cannot vote ''nyway. ^_^I love your unique and artistic perspective on things. And if this was not staged shot, GREAT and AMAZING timing, too.This is underrated IMHO. ', '2007-04-09 18:08:44.000000', NULL, 0),
