(3533674, 490456, 38032, '<td valign="top">This makes me think of this movie:<br/><a href="//en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Baraka_(film)" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Baraka</a> <br/>I don''t see how anyone would regret seeing it.</td>', 'This makes me think of this movie:Baraka I don''t see how anyone would regret seeing it.', '2007-04-09 18:44:58.000000', NULL, 0),
(3533737, 488752, 24454, '<td valign="top">I''m with Melethia:  this photo is way under rated and under appreciated in the Free Study challenge :(   It''s so beautiful and striking!  Wow!   I voted on so many photos, but I missed this in the challenge.  But I''m sure I would have voted it at least an 8 or 9!<br/> <br/>Sorry you got robbed!<br/> <br/></td>', 'I''m with Melethia:  this photo is way under rated and under appreciated in the Free Study challenge :(   It''s so beautiful and striking!  Wow!   I voted on so many photos, but I missed this in the challenge.  But I''m sure I would have voted it at least an 8 or 9! Sorry you got robbed! ', '2007-04-09 19:08:43.000000', NULL, 0),
