(3535745, 486405, 26017, '<td valign="top">:)<br/> <br/>These toads are not actually mating. This was a male and female toad in migration season trying to get to the breeding ground (which I assume is the massive lake not far away from my house.) There are at this time of the year loads of them crawling around on the roads and paths. Here is a little excert form the BBC nature website about what these toads are up to.<br/> <br/>"Although males usually wait for females at breeding sites, they will sometimes try to ambush them before they reach the water. Males clamber onto the backs of females and hold onto them tightly (a posture known as amplexus), the nuptial pads on their fingers providing extra grip. Over-eager males sometimes grab another male, but the captured males croak soon informs them of their mistake."</td>', ':) These toads are not actually mating. This was a male and female toad in migration season trying to get to the breeding ground (which I assume is the massive lake not far away from my house.) There are at this time of the year loads of them crawling around on the roads and paths. Here is a little excert form the BBC nature website about what these toads are up to. "Although males usually wait for females at breeding sites, they will sometimes try to ambush them before they reach the water. Males clamber onto the backs of females and hold onto them tightly (a posture known as amplexus), the nuptial pads on their fingers providing extra grip. Over-eager males sometimes grab another male, but the captured males croak soon informs them of their mistake."', '2007-04-10 14:11:02.000000', NULL, 0),
(3535973, 490962, 42100, '<td valign="top">Oh, you sly sneaky little thing...you sneak in here out of the blue and try to put one past me.  Great color, life and composition to this photo.  Let me tell you, it''s very hard to be unbiased about this because I hate clowns.  Or as my wife and daughter like to tease me...I''m afraid of clowns.  That''s just not true, don''t believe them.<br/> <br/>...and hey...look at that...you was here in the ''states.''  Couldn''t believe there would be a big old Chevy in France, and then I saw the location.<br/> <br/>Come around a little more often, been missin'' you around here!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2007-04-11 14:00:20.</i></td>', 'Oh, you sly sneaky little thing...you sneak in here out of the blue and try to put one past me.  Great color, life and composition to this photo.  Let me tell you, it''s very hard to be unbiased about this because I hate clowns.  Or as my wife and daughter like to tease me...I''m afraid of clowns.  That''s just not true, don''t believe them. ...and hey...look at that...you was here in the ''states.''  Couldn''t believe there would be a big old Chevy in France, and then I saw the location. Come around a little more often, been missin'' you around here!', '2007-04-10 15:35:21.000000', '2007-04-11 15:00:20.000000', 0),
