(3540697, 488336, 29011, '<td valign="top">A serene eye pleasing capture. Really like how you managed to isolate the blossom bunch so well. The overcast light gives the shot a nice softness. Nice that the sky isn''t all grey or white, it doesn''t compete with the buds. Perhaps a nice place to come back to during a sunrise/sunset to get some nice colors in the sky as well or during a clear day too, just to see a nice high contrast look too.</td>', 'A serene eye pleasing capture. Really like how you managed to isolate the blossom bunch so well. The overcast light gives the shot a nice softness. Nice that the sky isn''t all grey or white, it doesn''t compete with the buds. Perhaps a nice place to come back to during a sunrise/sunset to get some nice colors in the sky as well or during a clear day too, just to see a nice high contrast look too.', '2007-04-11 20:05:23.000000', NULL, 0),
(3540716, 490796, 18191, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Frankie_Lv:</b></div><hr/><i> Hello Tranquil,<br/>              If you truly shot this blindly from the waste there is nothing to say here but PERFECT !!!!!!!!!!. Incredible Image, Fanastic an absolute 10 in my book.<br/> <br/>Frankie/Las Vegas </i></td></tr></table> <br/>You can actually see my reflection in the window over her left shoulder if you brighten it up a little. No camera in front of my eyes!  :)</td>', 'Originally posted by Frankie_Lv: Hello Tranquil,              If you truly shot this blindly from the waste there is nothing to say here but PERFECT !!!!!!!!!!. Incredible Image, Fanastic an absolute 10 in my book. Frankie/Las Vegas  You can actually see my reflection in the window over her left shoulder if you brighten it up a little. No camera in front of my eyes!  :)', '2007-04-11 20:14:08.000000', NULL, 0),
(3540728, 490649, 15291, '<td valign="top">Hello Writeheart,<br/>                The framing here is well done, Nice to see the catch light in the eye a must for any closeup wildlife good job there. The background however is a killer, the white is very distracting &amp; the tree limbs keep drawing me away. The focus seams a wee bit soft ( hand held) I assume.I also see just a bit of a hotspot on the right side of the face just above the nose to the eye. Overall though you did a great job under the conditions put in front of you.</td>', 'Hello Writeheart,                The framing here is well done, Nice to see the catch light in the eye a must for any closeup wildlife good job there. The background however is a killer, the white is very distracting & the tree limbs keep drawing me away. The focus seams a wee bit soft ( hand held) I assume.I also see just a bit of a hotspot on the right side of the face just above the nose to the eye. Overall though you did a great job under the conditions put in front of you.', '2007-04-11 20:17:06.000000', NULL, 0),
