(3546269, 488379, 14986, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Marjo:</b></div><hr/><i> I like this, too. Way to go, Judy and Sony! Excellent detail and color.<br/>That dramatic sky makes such a great backdrop. <br/>Why won''t you be able to enter anymore?? </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>I decided not to renew my membership this time around.  I just don''t enter enough challenges anymore to make it worthwhile and if a member one does come along that I want to do, I''ll fork over the $5 monthly membership. :)   I do miss having a portfolio here and being able to sell the prints, but just don''t have the finances at the moment to justify it.  Thanks for your comments!</td>', 'Originally posted by Marjo: I like this, too. Way to go, Judy and Sony! Excellent detail and color.That dramatic sky makes such a great backdrop. Why won''t you be able to enter anymore??   I decided not to renew my membership this time around.  I just don''t enter enough challenges anymore to make it worthwhile and if a member one does come along that I want to do, I''ll fork over the $5 monthly membership. :)   I do miss having a portfolio here and being able to sell the prints, but just don''t have the finances at the moment to justify it.  Thanks for your comments!', '2007-04-13 19:55:45.000000', NULL, 0),
