(3548892, 490779, 60614, '<td valign="top">It may not have done well but it is a memory.  When I took the portrait of my son for the same challenge I used a polarizer because I too was taking the photo in he bright mid-day sun.  It helped cut some of the harshness.  When the shot is there you just have to take it.  Great composition and a great capture of the moment.</td>', 'It may not have done well but it is a memory.  When I took the portrait of my son for the same challenge I used a polarizer because I too was taking the photo in he bright mid-day sun.  It helped cut some of the harshness.  When the shot is there you just have to take it.  Great composition and a great capture of the moment.', '2007-04-15 09:41:57.000000', NULL, 0),
