(3555574, 490433, 34113, '<td valign="top">Having the couple looking away from the Calder makes this even more interesting. Hope they noticed it before going to the gift store. The pointing hand adds a very dynamic element. Good eye.</td>', 'Having the couple looking away from the Calder makes this even more interesting. Hope they noticed it before going to the gift store. The pointing hand adds a very dynamic element. Good eye.', '2007-04-17 16:16:04.000000', NULL, 0),
