(3561957, 480874, 68504, '<td valign="top">Wow colours. Ditto JuliBoc, but especially the green coat which pulls you up to the blossoms. (What is the white thing by the Wiem''s head?  His/her ear?)</td>', 'Wow colours. Ditto JuliBoc, but especially the green coat which pulls you up to the blossoms. (What is the white thing by the Wiem''s head?  His/her ear?)', '2007-04-19 02:31:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(3563834, 487765, 62318, '<td valign="top">Never sure how people can dole out 1''s for a FreeStudy. Well, I think this is a fun image. The color treatment works pretty well. It is one of those photos that grows on you the more you look at it.</td>', 'Never sure how people can dole out 1''s for a FreeStudy. Well, I think this is a fun image. The color treatment works pretty well. It is one of those photos that grows on you the more you look at it.', '2007-04-19 18:12:23.000000', NULL, 0),
(3563921, 484602, 62318, '<td valign="top">A near perfect shot and a wonderful picture. I always think animals are one of the toughest to shoot and you did a terrific job.</td>', 'A near perfect shot and a wonderful picture. I always think animals are one of the toughest to shoot and you did a terrific job.', '2007-04-19 18:48:21.000000', NULL, 0),
(3563935, 490849, 62318, '<td valign="top">Terrific capture! Good use of post and nice lighting. I''m always a fan of seeing the front of the person, but it works pretty well in this case. Overall I think it is a wonderful picture, maybe missing element either in the bottom of the frame or on the wall. Still, I like it a lot and glad it did so well for you in a Free Study. A solid 7 in my book. Cheers.</td>', 'Terrific capture! Good use of post and nice lighting. I''m always a fan of seeing the front of the person, but it works pretty well in this case. Overall I think it is a wonderful picture, maybe missing element either in the bottom of the frame or on the wall. Still, I like it a lot and glad it did so well for you in a Free Study. A solid 7 in my book. Cheers.', '2007-04-19 18:54:02.000000', NULL, 0),
(3563964, 483251, 62318, '<td valign="top">Congrats on the wonderful score for such a nice image. Very well conceived and a stunning capture. Love the blue background which compliments the subject very well.</td>', 'Congrats on the wonderful score for such a nice image. Very well conceived and a stunning capture. Love the blue background which compliments the subject very well.', '2007-04-19 19:03:00.000000', NULL, 0),
