(3565500, 491115, 51269, '<td valign="top">I gave this a 6- just amazing ! The detail &amp; sharpness are spot on, great job !</td>', 'I gave this a 6- just amazing ! The detail & sharpness are spot on, great job !', '2007-04-20 09:43:43.000000', NULL, 0),
(3566076, 482912, 63269, '<td valign="top">I love the smooth colors and the mist!</td>', 'I love the smooth colors and the mist!', '2007-04-20 13:40:07.000000', NULL, 0),
(3566748, 488090, 62318, '<td valign="top">I really like what is going on here. The textures, light, and colors are all wonderful. I just think something is missing, maybe a bigger leaf? It is one of those photos that almost has it all, just missing a little something. Still I really like the idea and think that the uniqueness is really what is most important anyhow. Well done.</td>', 'I really like what is going on here. The textures, light, and colors are all wonderful. I just think something is missing, maybe a bigger leaf? It is one of those photos that almost has it all, just missing a little something. Still I really like the idea and think that the uniqueness is really what is most important anyhow. Well done.', '2007-04-20 18:12:50.000000', NULL, 0),
