(3644628, 490791, 55838, '<td valign="top">Ooooo I like this.  Fabulous vibrant colors and DOF.  Looks abstract (which I like).  For some reason abstract looking images don''t score high enough on DPC IMO and this is an example of an underated abstract shot (unless it was that April Fools mess that impacted your score).  I would love to see a little Guassian Blur on the background to get rid some of the grain although I suspect others find the texture attractive.  Nicely done!  I didn''t get around to voting on your shot but I would have voted it high.</td>', 'Ooooo I like this.  Fabulous vibrant colors and DOF.  Looks abstract (which I like).  For some reason abstract looking images don''t score high enough on DPC IMO and this is an example of an underated abstract shot (unless it was that April Fools mess that impacted your score).  I would love to see a little Guassian Blur on the background to get rid some of the grain although I suspect others find the texture attractive.  Nicely done!  I didn''t get around to voting on your shot but I would have voted it high.', '2007-05-13 17:37:54.000000', NULL, 0),
(3650435, 478680, 30982, '<td valign="top">Looks very regal despite his small size!  I like how you can see the detail in the individual feathers on his chest, too.</td>', 'Looks very regal despite his small size!  I like how you can see the detail in the individual feathers on his chest, too.', '2007-05-15 04:34:17.000000', NULL, 0),
(3650447, 479158, 34938, '<td valign="top">aaaaaarrrrgggghhhhh! that looks scary! It''s really impactful and I like your composition. Hope you didn''t cut yourself! I am getting goosebumps just looking at it...well done</td>', 'aaaaaarrrrgggghhhhh! that looks scary! It''s really impactful and I like your composition. Hope you didn''t cut yourself! I am getting goosebumps just looking at it...well done', '2007-05-15 04:46:01.000000', NULL, 0),
(3652154, 491034, 30982, '<td valign="top">A sense of fun and independence.  Each of the ladies seems to be doing her own thing, yet they''re part of the whole.  The warm light adds a sense of, well, warmth!  For strictly DPC purposes, you should of course have brought a freakin'' huge backdrop with you, but I''m assuming since it''s a local troupe that having recognizable city structures as the backdrop suits this well.  I kinda like real backgrounds!</td>', 'A sense of fun and independence.  Each of the ladies seems to be doing her own thing, yet they''re part of the whole.  The warm light adds a sense of, well, warmth!  For strictly DPC purposes, you should of course have brought a freakin'' huge backdrop with you, but I''m assuming since it''s a local troupe that having recognizable city structures as the backdrop suits this well.  I kinda like real backgrounds!', '2007-05-15 17:05:08.000000', NULL, 0),
(3652215, 491034, 50695, '<td valign="top">For all their bright clothing, they blend into the background a little bit. This might look much better at poster size. As it is, I feel I''m missing too much detail. I did give it a 6, though, because I thought it was an interesting subject and I liked the lighting.</td>', 'For all their bright clothing, they blend into the background a little bit. This might look much better at poster size. As it is, I feel I''m missing too much detail. I did give it a 6, though, because I thought it was an interesting subject and I liked the lighting.', '2007-05-15 17:16:23.000000', NULL, 0),
(3652247, 491034, 67697, '<td valign="top">The lighting certainly is gorgeous.  Love the colors that the women have on their clothing.  But without reading your description, I would have thought you were a passer-by taking a snapshot.  Not all the women are focused in the direction of the photographer (you) and their poses are not coordinated well.  These reasons, plus the busy background, are what prompted this reaction.</td>', 'The lighting certainly is gorgeous.  Love the colors that the women have on their clothing.  But without reading your description, I would have thought you were a passer-by taking a snapshot.  Not all the women are focused in the direction of the photographer (you) and their poses are not coordinated well.  These reasons, plus the busy background, are what prompted this reaction.', '2007-05-15 17:29:06.000000', NULL, 0),
